< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"deepseek_reasoning","summary":[],"content":["Now I have a clear picture. Let me plan the Round 3 expansion:\n\n**New Data Files (5):**\n1. `src/data/solutions.json` — 8+ cross-capability solutions\n2. `src/data/case-studies.json` — 8+ detailed case studies (expand from 3 existing cases + 5 new)\n3. `src/data/articles.json` — 12+ article summaries with sections\n4. `src/data/offices.json` — global office details\n5. `src/data/careers.json` — job listings, career paths, values, interview process\n\n**New CSS (5):**\n6. `src/css/solutions.css`\n7. `src/css/case-studies.css`\n8. `src/css/articles.css`\n9. `src/css/offices.css`\n10. `src/css/careers.css`\n\n**New JS (5):**\n11. `src/js/solutions.js`\n12. `src/js/case-studies.js`\n13. `src/js/articles.js`\n14. `src/js/offices.js`\n15. `src/js/careers.js`\n\n**Updated Files:**\n16. `src/index.html` — add sections for solutions, detailed case studies, expanded articles, offices, expanded careers\n17. `src/css/main.css` — import new CSS\n18. `src/js/main.js` — add rendering functions for new sections\n19. `scripts/validate.mjs` — validate all new content\n\nLet me start creating data files first, then CSS, then JS, then HTML, then validation.\n\nFor the index.html, I need to decide placement:\n- Hero\n- Stats\n- Capabilities\n- Solutions (NEW - after capabilities, before services)\n- Services\n- Methodology\n- Case Studies (EXPANDED - replace current cases section)\n- Industries\n- Regions/Offices (EXPANDED - replace current regions with offices section)\n- Insights/Articles (EXPANDED)\n- Leadership\n- Careers (EXPANDED)\n- Contact\n- Footer\n\nThis is going to be a lot of content. Let me start with data files."]},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e301b-8339-7881-80a3-28c37b98135d","completedAtMs":1778923614178}}
