ented organizations. Experience in org design and change management required.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"job-05\",\n      \"title\": { \"zh\": \"网络安全顾问 — 零信任架构\", \"en\": \"Cybersecurity Consultant — Zero Trust Architecture\" },\n      \"path\": \"path-consulting\",\n      \"location\": \"dubai\",\n      \"region\": \"emea\",\n      \"type\": { \"zh\": \"全职\", \"en\": \"Full-time\" },\n      \"summary\": { \"zh\": \"为中东客户设计和实施零信任安全架构。需要 OT/ICS 安全经验。\", \"en\": \"Design and implement zero-trust security architectures for Middle Eastern clients. OT/ICS security experience required.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"job-06\",\n      \"title\": { \"zh\": \"数据工程师 — 数据平台架构\", \"en\": \"Data Engineer — Data Platform Architecture\" },\n      \"path\": \"path-data-ai\",\n      \"location\": \"new-york\",\n      \"region\": \"amer\",\n      \"type\": { \"zh\": \"全职\", \"en\": \"Full-time\" },\n      \"summary\": { \"zh\": \"为北美金融和零售客户构建湖仓一体数据平台。需要 Spark、dbt 和云数据服务经验。\", \"en\": \"Build lakehouse data platforms for North American financial and retail clients. Experience with Spark, dbt, and cloud data services required.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"job-07\",\n      \"title\": { \"zh\": \"初级工程师 — 云原生开发\", \"en\": \"Associate Engineer — Cloud-Native Development\" },\n      \"path\": \"path-engineering\",\n      \"location\": \"mumbai\",\n      \"region\": \"apac\",\n      \"type\": { \"zh\": \"全职\", \"en\": \"Full-time\" },\n      \"summary\": { \"zh\": \"加入我们的孟买全球交付中心，参与全球客户的云原生应用开发项目。\", \"en\": \"Join our Mumbai global delivery center to work on cloud-native application development for global clients.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"job-08\",\n      \"title\": { \"zh\": \"战略咨询经理 — 可持续技术\", \"en\": \"Strategy Consulting Manager — Sustainable Technology\" },\n      \"path\": \"path-consulting\",\n      \"location\": \"berlin\",\n      \"region\": \"emea\",\n      \"type\": { \"zh\": \"全职\", \"en\": \"Full-time\" },\n      \"summary\": { \"zh\": \"领导欧洲客户的可持