中国和日本制造业巨头的真实转型数据，我们提出了产品型组织转型的五阶段框架。\", \"en\": \"Based on real transformation data from three Chinese and Japanese manufacturing giants, we propose a five-stage framework for product-oriented org transformation.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"诊断与设计\", \"试点团队选取\", \"规模化推广\", \"文化转型\", \"持续改进机制\"], \"en\": [\"Diagnosis & Design\", \"Pilot Team Selection\", \"Scaling Out\", \"Culture Transformation\", \"Continuous Improvement\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"王敏\", \"en\": \"Min Wang\" }, { \"zh\": \"佐藤健一\", \"en\": \"Kenichi Sato\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-04\",\n    \"category\": \"data-intelligence\",\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-08\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"9 分钟\", \"en\": \"9 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"数据网格两年回顾：承诺、陷阱与实践者指南\", \"en\": \"Data Mesh Two Years In: Promises, Pitfalls, and a Practitioner's Guide\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"数据网格从热门概念走向实际落地。基于 30+ 实施项目的经验，我们复盘了什么有效、什么需要重新思考。\", \"en\": \"Data mesh moves from hype to implementation. Based on 30+ project experiences, we review what works and what needs rethinking.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"数据产品定义之争\", \"联邦治理的实践\", \"技术选型困境\", \"组织变革挑战\"], \"en\": [\"The Data Product Definition Debate\", \"Federated Governance in Practice\", \"Technology Selection Dilemmas\", \"Organizational Change Challenges\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Anna Lindström\", \"en\": \"Anna Lindström\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-05\",\n    \"category\": \"cyber-resilience\",\n    \"region\": \"global\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-25\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"11 分钟\", \"en\": \"11 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"2026 网络威胁格局：AI 攻防新战场\", \"en\": \"2026 Cyber Threat Landscape: The New AI Attack-Defense Battlefield\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"AI 既是武器也是盾牌。我们分析了 2026 年最重要的五类 AI 驱动的网络威胁及对应防御策略。\", \"en\": \"AI is both weapon and shield. We analyze the five most significant AI-driven cyber threats of 2026 and corresponding defense strategies.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"AI 驱动的社会工程\", \"深度伪造攻击\", \"供应链 AI 风险\", \"防御性 AI 框架\", \"监管趋势\"], \"en\": [\"AI-Driven Social Engineering\", \"Deepfake Attacks\", \"Supply Chain AI Risk\", \"Defensive AI Frameworks\", \"Regulatory Trends\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"David Okonkwo\", \"en\": \"David Okonkwo\" }, { \"zh\": \"李浩然\", \"en\": \"Haoran Li\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-06\",\n    \"category\": \"strategy-advisory\",\n    \"region\": \"global\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-12\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"15 分钟\", \"en\": \"15 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"2026 全球技术投资展望：AI 主导，云与安全紧随\", \"en\": \"2026 Global Tech Investment Outlook: AI Leads, Cloud and Security Follow\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"年度旗舰报告：覆盖 30 个国家、12 个行业的 5,000 亿美元技术支出分析，含 AI、云、安全的三年预测。\", \"en\": \"Annual flagship report: analysis of USD 500B in tech spending across 30 countries and 12 industries, with 3-year forecasts for AI, cloud, and security.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"全球技术支出总览\", \"AI 投资趋势\", \"云基础设施\", \"安全支出\", \"区域差异\", \"行业基准\"], \"en\": [\"Global Tech Spending Overview\", \"AI Investment Trends\", \"Cloud Infrastructure\", \"Security Spending\", \"Regional Variations\", \"Industry Benchmarks\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"林小燕\", \"en\": \"Xiaoyan Lin\" }, { \"zh\": \"Sarah Mitchell\", \"en\": \"Sarah Mitchell\" }, { \"zh\": \"Rahul Kapoor\", \"en\": \"Rahul Kapoor\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-07\",\n    \"category\": \"ai-strategy\",\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-02-28\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"7 分钟\", \"en\": \"7 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"GenAI 在中国金融业的合规落地路径\", \"en\": \"GenAI Compliance Pathways in Chinese Financial Services\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"中国金融监管机构对生成式 AI 的态度日趋明确。本文提出了符合最新监管指引的 GenAI 实施框架。\", \"en\": \"Chinese financial regulators are providing clearer guidance on generative AI. This article proposes a GenAI implementation framework aligned with the latest regulatory directives.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"监管环境分析\", \"合规实施框架\", \"风控模型治理\", \"典型案例\"], \"en\": [\"Regulatory Environment Analysis\", \"Compliance Implementation Framework\", \"Risk Model Governance\", \"Case Examples\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"张伟\", \"en\": \"Wei Zhang\" }, { \"zh\": \"陈思远\", \"en\": \"Siyuan Chen\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-08\",\n    \"category\": \"code-modernization\",\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-02-15\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"6 分钟\", \"en\": \"6 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"Green Code：软件碳效率的工程实践\", \"en\": \"Green Code: Engineering Practices for Software Carbon Efficiency\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"可持续软件工程从理论走向工程实践。我们提出了可量化的绿色编码模式及其对云成本的直接影响。\", \"en\": \"Sustainable software engineering moves from theory to engineering practice. We propose quantifiable green coding patterns and their direct impact on cloud costs.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"碳感知架构\", \"能效编码模式\", \"云资源优化\", \"测量与报告\"], \"en\": [\"Carbon-Aware Architecture\", \"Energy-Efficient Coding Patterns\", \"Cloud Resource Optimization\", \"Measurement & Reporting\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Anna Lindström\", \"en\": \"Anna Lindström\" }, { \"zh\": \"Thomas Wright\", \"en\": \"Thomas Wright\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-09\",\n    \"category\": \"operating-model\",\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-01-30\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"8 分钟\", \"en\": \"8 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"工程师体验的四个维度：超越工具与流程\", \"en\": \"The Four Dimensions of Developer Experience: Beyond Tools and Processes\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"开发者体验（DevEx）已成为技术人才竞争的关键差异化因素。我们提出了覆盖工具、流程、文化与职业的四维 DevEx 框架。\", \"en\": \"Developer Experience (DevEx) has become a critical differentiator in the tech talent war. We propose a four-dimensional DevEx framework covering tools, processes, culture, and career.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"工具维度\", \"流程维度\", \"文化维度\", \"职业维度\", \"度量与实践\"],