家中国和日本制造业巨头的真实转型数据，我们提出了产品型组织转型的五阶段框架。\", \"en\": \"Based on real transformation data from three Chinese and Japanese manufacturing giants, we propose a five-stage framework for product-oriented org transformation.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"诊断与设计\", \"试点团队选取\", \"规模化推广\", \"文化转型\", \"持续改进机制\"], \"en\": [\"Diagnosis & Design\", \"Pilot Team Selection\", \"Scaling Out\", \"Culture Transformation\", \"Continuous Improvement\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"王敏\", \"en\": \"Min Wang\" }, { \"zh\": \"佐藤健一\", \"en\": \"Kenichi Sato\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-04\",\n    \"category\": \"data-intelligence\",\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-04-08\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"9 分钟\", \"en\": \"9 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"数据网格两年回顾：承诺、陷阱与实践者指南\", \"en\": \"Data Mesh Two Years In: Promises, Pitfalls, and a Practitioner's Guide\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"数据网格从热门概念走向实际落地。基于 30+ 实施项目的经验，我们复盘了什么有效、什么需要重新思考。\", \"en\": \"Data mesh moves from hype to implementation. Based on 30+ project experiences, we review what works and what needs rethinking.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"数据产品定义之争\", \"联邦治理的实践\", \"技术选型困境\", \"组织变革挑战\"], \"en\": [\"The Data Product Definition Debate\", \"Federated Governance in Practice\", \"Technology Selection Dilemmas\", \"Organizational Change Challenges\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Anna Lindström\", \"en\": \"Anna Lindström\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-05\",\n    \"category\": \"cyber-resilience\",\n    \"region\": \"global\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-25\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"11 分钟\", \"en\": \"11 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"2026 网络威胁格局：AI 攻防新战场\", \"en\": \"2026 Cyber Threat Landscape: The New AI Attack-Defense Battlefield\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"AI 既是武器也是盾牌。我们分析了 2026 年最重要的五类 AI 驱动的网络威胁及对应防御策略。\", \"en\": \"AI is both weapon and shield. We analyze the five most significant AI-driven cyber threats of 2026 and corresponding defense strategies.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"AI 驱动的社会工程\", \"深度伪造攻击\", \"供应链 AI 风险\", \"防御性 AI 框架\", \"监管趋势\"], \"en\": [\"AI-Driven Social Engineering\", \"Deepfake Attacks\", \"Supply Chain AI Risk\", \"Defensive AI Frameworks\", \"Regulatory Trends\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"David Okonkwo\", \"en\": \"David Okonkwo\" }, { \"zh\": \"李浩然\", \"en\": \"Haoran Li\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-06\",\n    \"category\": \"strategy-advisory\",\n    \"region\": \"global\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-12\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"15 分钟\", \"en\": \"15 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"2026 全球技术投资展望：AI 主导，云与安全紧随\", \"en\": \"2026 Global Tech Investment Outlook: AI Leads, Cloud and Security Follow\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"年度旗舰报告：覆盖 30 个国家、12 个行业的 5,000 亿美元技术支出分析，含 AI、云、安全的三年预测。\", \"en\": \"Annual flagship report: analysis of USD 500B in tech spending across 30 countries and 12 industries, with 3-year forecasts for AI, cloud, and security.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"全球技术支出总览\", \"AI 投资趋势\", \"云基础设施\", \"安全支出\", \"区域差异\", \"行业基准\"], \"en\": [\"Global Tech Spending Overview\", \"AI Investment Trends\", \"Cloud Infrastructure\", \"Security Spending\", \"Regional Variations\", \"Industry Benchmarks\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"林小燕\", \"en\": \"Xiaoyan Lin\" }, { \"zh\": \"Sarah Mitchell\", \"en\": \"Sarah Mitchell\" }, { \"zh\": \"Rahul Kapoor\", \"en\": \"Rahul Kapoor\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-07\",\n    \"category\": \"ai-strategy\",\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-02-28\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"7 分钟\", \"en\": \"7 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"GenAI 在中国金融业的合规落地路径\", \"en\": \"GenAI Compliance Pathways in Chinese Financial Services\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"中国金融监管机构对生成式 AI 的态度日趋明确。本文提出了符合最新监管指引的 GenAI 实施框架。\", \"en\": \"Chinese financial regulators are providing clearer guidance on generative AI. This article proposes a GenAI implementation framework aligned with the latest regulatory directives.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"监管环境分析\", \"合规实施框架\", \"风控模型治理\", \"典型案例\"], \"en\": [\"Regulatory Environment Analysis\", \"Compliance Implementation Framework\", \"Risk Model Governance\", \"Case Examples\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"张伟\", \"en\": \"Wei Zhang\" }, { \"zh\": \"陈思远\", \"en\": \"Siyuan Chen\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-08\",\n    \"category\": \"code-modernization\",\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-02-15\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"6 分钟\", \"en\": \"6 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"Green Code：软件碳效率的工程实践\", \"en\": \"Green Code: Engineering Practices for Software Carbon Efficiency\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"可持续软件工程从理论走向工程实践。我们提出了可量化的绿色编码模式及其对云成本的直接影响。\", \"en\": \"Sustainable software engineering moves from theory to engineering practice. We propose quantifiable green coding patterns and their direct impact on cloud costs.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"碳感知架构\", \"能效编码模式\", \"云资源优化\", \"测量与报告\"], \"en\": [\"Carbon-Aware Architecture\", \"Energy-Efficient Coding Patterns\", \"Cloud Resource Optimization\", \"Measurement & Reporting\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Anna Lindström\", \"en\": \"Anna Lindström\" }, { \"zh\": \"Thomas Wright\", \"en\": \"Thomas Wright\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-09\",\n    \"category\": \"operating-model\",\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-01-30\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"8 分钟\", \"en\": \"8 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"工程师体验的四个维度：超越工具与流程\", \"en\": \"The Four Dimensions of Developer Experience: Beyond Tools and Processes\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"开发者体验（DevEx）已成为技术人才竞争的关键差异化因素。我们提出了覆盖工具、流程、文化与职业的四维 DevEx 框架。\", \"en\": \"Developer Experience (DevEx) has become a critical differentiator in the tech talent war. We propose a four-dimensional DevEx framework covering tools, processes, culture, and career.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"工具维度\", \"流程维度\", \"文化维度\", \"职业维度\", \"度量与实践\"], \"en\": [\"Tools Dimension\", \"Process Dimension\", \"Culture Dimension\", \"Career Dimension\", \"Metrics & Practices\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Emily Chen\", \"en\": \"Emily Chen\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-10\",\n    \"category\": \"data-intelligence\",\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-01-18\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"10 分钟\", \"en\": \"10 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"实时数据管道的七大反模式与规避策略\", \"en\": \"Seven Anti-Patterns in Real-Time Data Pipelines and How to Avoid Them\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"基于对 100+ 企业实时数据处理系统的诊断，我们总结了最常见的设计错误及工程化解决方案。\", \"en\": \"Based on diagnostics of 100+ enterprise real-time data processing systems, we summarize the most common design mistakes and engineering solutions.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"架构反模式\", \"数据质量陷阱\", \"运维反模式\", \"成本失控\", \"最佳实践\"], \"en\": [\"Architecture Anti-Patterns\", \"Data Quality Traps\", \"Operations Anti-Patterns\", \"Cost Runaway\", \"Best Practices\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Rajesh Menon\", \"en\": \"Rajesh Menon\" }, { \"zh\": \"黄丽华\", \"en\": \"Lihua Huang\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-11\",\n    \"category\": \"strategy-advisory\",\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-12-20\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"9 分钟\", \"en\": \"9 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"技术尽职调查 2.0：AI 时代的并购新范式\", \"en\": \"Tech Due Diligence 2.0: A New Paradigm for M&A in the AI Era\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"传统的技术尽调已经不足以评估 AI 公司的价值。我们提出了覆盖数据资产、模型质量与 AI 治理的全新框架。\", \"en\": \"Traditional tech due diligence is insufficient for valuing AI companies. We propose a new framework covering data assets, model quality, and AI governance.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"数据资产评估\", \"模型质量审计\", \"AI 人才评估\", \"技术债务量化\", \"整合风险矩阵\"], \"en\": [\"Data Asset Valuation\", \"Model Quality Audit\", \"AI Talent Assessment\", \"Technical Debt Quantification\", \"Integration Risk Matrix\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"Sarah Mitchell\", \"en\": \"Sarah Mitchell\" }, { \"zh\": \"陈思远\", \"en\": \"Siyuan Chen\" }]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"art-12\",\n    \"category\": \"cyber-resilience\",\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-12-05\",\n    \"readingTime\": { \"zh\": \"7 分钟\", \"en\": \"7 min\" },\n    \"headline\": { \"zh\": \"关键基础设施的 OT 安全：亚太视角\", \"en\": \"OT Security for Critical Infrastructure: An Asia-Pacific Perspective\" },\n    \"deck\": { \"zh\": \"亚太地区的关键基础设施面临独特的 OT 安全挑战。本文提出了基于 IEC 62443 的实用安全框架。\", \"en\": \"Critical infrastructure in Asia-Pacific faces unique OT security challenges. This article proposes a practical security framework based on IEC 62443.\" },\n    \"sections\": { \"zh\": [\"OT 威胁格局\", \"IEC 62443 实施路径\", \"IT/OT 融合安全\", \"区域合规要求\"], \"en\": [\"OT Threat Landscape\", \"IEC 62443 Implementation Path\", \"IT/OT Convergence Security\", \"Regional Compliance Requirements\"] },\n    \"authors\": [{ \"zh\": \"David Okonkwo\", \"en\": \"David Okonkwo\" }, { \"zh\": \"李浩然\", \"en\": \"Haoran Li\" }]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE"}],"aggregatedOutput":null,"exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e301b-8339-7881-80a3-28c37b98135d","completedAtMs":1778924188954}}
< {"method":"item/started","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_01_Xan9d4CUVNLArJqK73qr2360","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/case-studies.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"bank-ai-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"欧洲顶级全能银行（资产 > 5000 亿欧元）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Top European universal bank (assets > EUR 500B)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"financial-services\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该银行拥有 12 条业务线和超过 200 个独立数据源，AI 项目分散在各业务线，缺乏统一平台与治理。模型从开发到上线平均耗时 9 个月。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 12 business lines and over 200 independent data sources, AI projects were scattered across silos with no unified platform or governance. Model time-to-production averaged 9 months.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 团队首先完成了全行 AI 就绪度评估，识别出 47 个高价值用例。随后设计了企业级 AI 平台架构（模型训练、推理、监控一体化），并帮助建立了 AI 治理委员会与负责任 AI 框架。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing first completed a bank-wide AI readiness assessment, identifying 47 high-value use cases. We then designed an enterprise AI platform architecture (unified training, inference, monitoring) and helped establish an AI governance council and responsible AI framework.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 Kubernetes 的多租户 ML 平台，集成特征存储、模型注册中心与实时推理管道。采用联邦学习架构保护各业务线数据隐私。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Kubernetes-based multi-tenant ML platform with integrated feature store, model registry, and real-time inference pipelines. Federated learning architecture to protect business-line data privacy.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"模型推理延迟降低 60%\\\", \\\"AI 用例从概念到上线时间从 9 个月缩短至 8 周\\\", \\\"平台承载 12 条业务线、47 个活跃模型\\\", \\\"AI 治理合规覆盖率达到 100%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Model inference latency reduced 60%\\\", \\\"AI use-case time-to-production from 9 months to 8 weeks\\\", \\\"Platform serving 12 business lines, 47 active models\\\", \\\"AI governance compliance coverage at 100%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-09 至 2025-12（16 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"推理延迟降低\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Latency reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"60%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"用例上线时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Time-to-production\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"8 周 / wks\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"活跃模型数\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Active models\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"47\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"retail-platform-migration\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"北美零售巨头（年营收 > 500 亿美元）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"North American retail giant (revenue > USD 50B)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"retail-consumer\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该公司核心交易系统运行在 20 年前的大型机单体架构上。黑色星期五流量高峰时系统多次濒临崩溃，每次变更需要 6 周冻结期。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The core transaction system ran on a 20-year-old mainframe monolith. The system nearly collapsed during Black Friday peaks, and every change required a 6-week freeze period.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计了绞杀者迁移策略：先从结账服务开始分拆，逐步将库存、定价、促销等模块迁移至 AWS 上的云原生微服务。同步建设了 GitOps 驱动的 CI/CD 流水线和混沌工程实践。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed a strangler-fig migration strategy: starting with checkout, progressively extracting inventory, pricing, and promotions into cloud-native microservices on AWS. Simultaneously built GitOps-driven CI/CD pipelines and chaos engineering practices.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 AWS EKS 的事件驱动微服务架构，使用 Kafka 实现异步解耦，DynamoDB 处理峰值事务，Istio 服务网格管理流量。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Event-driven microservices on AWS EKS, with Kafka for async decoupling, DynamoDB for peak transactions, Istio service mesh for traffic management.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"部署频率从每月 2 次提升至每日 20+ 次\\\", \\\"黑色星期五系统可用性达到 99.99%\\\", \\\"变更失败率从 35% 降至 2%\\\", \\\"基础设施成本降低 30%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Deploy frequency from 2/month to 20+/day\\\", \\\"Black Friday availability at 99.99%\\\", \\\"Change failure rate from 35% to 2%\\\", \\\"Infrastructure cost reduced 30%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-03 至 2025-09（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"部署频率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Deploy frequency\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"每日 20+ / 20+/day\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"系统可用性\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Availability\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"99.99%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"变更失败率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Change failure rate\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2%\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"manufacturing-operating-model\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"中国先进制造企业（全球 50+ 工厂）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Chinese advanced manufacturer (50+ factories globally)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"manufacturing\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"operating-model\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该企业拥有超过 2,000 名工程师分布在全球 5 个研发中心，但按职能（前端、后端、QA、运维）组织的团队导致交付缓慢，跨团队协调成本极高。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 2,000+ engineers across 5 global R&D centers, the functionally-organized teams (frontend, backend, QA, ops) caused slow delivery and extremely high cross-team coordination costs.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计并推动了从职能型到产品型组织的转型：定义了 18 个产品领域、重组了 150+ 跨职能产品团队、建立了季度 OKR 节奏和产品运营委员会。同步建设了内部开发者平台以支持团队自治。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed and drove the transformation from functional to product-oriented: defined 18 product domains, reorganized into 150+ cross-functional product teams, established quarterly OKR cadence and product operations council. Built an IDP in parallel to support team autonomy.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"产品型组织架构分为 4 个业务单元 × 18 个产品领域，每个产品团队 8–12 人，配备产品经理、技术负责人和交付经理。IDP 提供自服务基础设施。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Product-oriented org structure with 4 business units × 18 product domains, each product team 8–12 people with PM, tech lead, and delivery manager. IDP provides self-service infrastructure.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"功能交付周期从 12 周缩短至 4 周\\\", \\\"工程师满意度调查得分提升 35%\\\", \\\"跨团队依赖项从 80 个减少至 15 个\\\", \\\"产品团队在 6 个月内实现全面自治\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Feature delivery cycle from 12 weeks to 4 weeks\\\", \\\"Engineer satisfaction survey scores +35%\\\", \\\"Cross-team dependencies from 80 to 15\\\", \\\"Product teams fully autonomous within 6 months\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-06 至 2025-06（12 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"交付周期\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Delivery cycle\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"4 周 / wks\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"工程师满意度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Eng. satisfaction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+35%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"跨团队依赖\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Cross-team deps\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"15\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"healthcare-fhir-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"北美大型医疗集团（50+ 医院网络）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Large North American healthcare network (50+ hospitals)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"healthcare\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"患者数据分散在 18 个不同的 EHR 系统、影像系统和实验室系统中。医生在诊断时需要手动查阅多个系统，平均耗时 15 分钟/患者。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Patient data scattered across 18 different EHR systems, imaging systems, and lab systems. Physicians spent an average of 15 minutes per patient manually consulting multiple systems during diagnosis.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 以 FHIR R4 标准构建了统一临床数据平台，在此之上开发了 AI 辅助临床决策支持系统。同步实施了零信任数据访问架构以保护 PHI。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing built a unified clinical data platform using FHIR R4 standards, then developed an AI-assisted clinical decision support system on top. Simultaneously implemented zero-trust data access architecture to protect PHI.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"FHIR 数据互操作层连接所有 EHR 系统，临床数据湖存储标准化患者记录，AI 模型在 HIPAA 合规环境中运行，提供实时诊断建议和药物相互作用预警。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"FHIR interoperability layer connecting all EHR systems, clinical data lake storing standardized patient records, AI models running in HIPAA-compliant environment delivering real-time diagnostic suggestions and drug interaction alerts.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"医生诊断准备时间从 15 分钟降至 2 分钟\\\", \\\"跨系统数据共享时间从数天降至近实时\\\", \\\"AI 辅助诊断准确率达专家水平（95% 一致性）\\\", \\\"零数据泄露事件（12 个月运行）\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Physician diagnostic prep time from 15 min to 2 min\\\", \\\"Cross-system data sharing from days to near real-time\\\", \\\"AI-assisted diagnosis accuracy at expert level (95% concordance)\\\", \\\"Zero data breach incidents (12-month run)\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-01 至 2025-06（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"诊断准备时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Diag. prep time\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2 分钟 / min\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"AI 一致性\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"AI concordance\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"95%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"安全事件\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Security incidents\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"0\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"energy-digital-twin\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"中东国家能源公司\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Middle Eastern national energy company\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"energy\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该公司的上游钻井和下游炼化系统由老化的 SCADA 控制，碳排放数据分散且不可审计。需要在 2030 年前实现 30% 碳减排，但缺乏量化基线。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Upstream drilling and downstream refining controlled by aging SCADA systems. Carbon emissions data was scattered and unauditable. Needed 30% carbon reduction by 2030 but lacked a quantified baseline.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 构建了涵盖上游到下游的数字孪生平台，集成实时 SCADA 数据与碳排放监测。部署了 AI 驱动的预测性维护和能耗优化算法，并升级了 OT 安全架构。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing built a digital twin platform spanning upstream to downstream, integrating real-time SCADA data with carbon monitoring. Deployed AI-driven predictive maintenance and energy optimization algorithms, and upgraded OT security architecture.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"边缘计算网关采集 SCADA 数据，通过安全数据总线进入云端数字孪生引擎。AI 优化引擎运行在封闭的 OT 环境中，碳排放仪表板连接至国家 ESG 报告系统。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Edge computing gateways collect SCADA data through secure data bus into cloud digital twin engine. AI optimization engine runs in air-gapped OT environment. Carbon dashboard connects to national ESG reporting system.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"碳排放预测准确率达到 95%\\\", \\\"非计划停机减少 35%\\\", \\\"能耗降低 18%（相当于减排 120,000 吨 CO2/年）\\\", \\\"OT 安全合规达到 IEC 62443 标准\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Carbon emission forecast accuracy at 95%\\\", \\\"Unplanned downtime reduced 35%\\\", \\\"Energy consumption reduced 18% (equivalent to 120,000 tonnes CO2/year)\\\", \\\"OT security compliance at IEC 62443\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-04 至 2025-12（20 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"碳预测准确率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Carbon forecast accuracy\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"95%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"能耗降低\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Energy reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"18%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"年减排\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Annual CO2 reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"120k 吨\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"gov-digital-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"东南亚国家数字化政府机构\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Southeast Asian national digital government agency\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"public-sector\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"strategy-advisory\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该国政府的 200+ 项公民服务分布在 40 个不同部门网站上，用户体验碎片化。公民平均需要访问 3 个网站才能完成一项跨部门服务。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The government's 200+ citizen services were spread across 40 different agency websites with fragmented UX. Citizens needed to visit an average of 3 websites to complete a single cross-agency service.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 协助设计了国家数字服务平台战略，构建了统一公民身份认证系统、服务编排引擎和跨部门数据交换网关。以敏捷方式在 6 个月内交付了首批 20 项高频服务。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing helped design the national digital service platform strategy, building unified citizen identity, service orchestration engine, and cross-agency data exchange gateway. Delivered the first 20 high-frequency services in 6 months using agile delivery.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于微服务架构的政府数字平台，统一身份认证（OAuth 2.0 / OIDC），API 网关连接 40+ 部门后端系统，事件驱动架构实现跨部门业务流程编排。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Microservices-based government digital platform, unified identity (OAuth 2.0 / OIDC), API gateway connecting 40+ agency backend systems, event-driven architecture for cross-agency business process orchestration.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"公民服务满意度从 52% 提升至 84%\\\", \\\"跨部门服务完成时间从平均 7 天缩短至 2 小时\\\", \\\"首批 20 项服务在 6 个月内上线\\\", \\\"平台日活跃用户超过 200 万\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Citizen service satisfaction from 52% to 84%\\\", \\\"Cross-agency service completion time from 7 days to 2 hours\\\", \\\"First 20 services live in 6 months\\\", \\\"Platform DAU exceeding 2 million\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-02 至 2025-08（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"公民满意度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Citizen satisfaction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"84%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"服务完成时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Service completion\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2 小时 / hrs\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"日活跃用户\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"DAU\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"200 万+\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"automotive-sdv-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"欧洲豪华汽车制造商\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"European luxury automotive manufacturer\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"automotive\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"operating-model\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该制造商从硬件定义向软件定义汽车转型，但传统 ECU 开发流程（V 模型、ASPICE）与敏捷软件开发文化存在根本冲突。OTA 更新审批流程长达 3 个月。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The manufacturer was transitioning from hardware-defined to software-defined vehicles, but traditional ECU development processes (V-model, ASPICE) fundamentally conflicted with agile software culture. OTA update approvals took 3 months.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计了 SDV 参考架构和符合 ISO 26262 / ISO 21434 的 CI/CD 流水线，建立了车云一体化开发平台。同步在 3 个车型团队中试点了产品型运营模式，将 OTA 审批流程自动化。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed an SDV reference architecture and ISO 26262 / ISO 21434-compliant CI/CD pipeline, establishing a vehicle-cloud unified development platform. Simultaneously piloted the product operating model in 3 vehicle program teams and automated the OTA approval process.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"集中式车辆计算机 + 区域控制器架构，车端运行实时容器化运行时（AUTOSAR Adaptive），云端 CI/CD 流水线包含功能安全验证门禁，OTA 管道采用 TUF 安全更新框架。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Central vehicle computer + zonal controller architecture, real-time containerized runtime on-vehicle (AUTOSAR Adaptive), cloud CI/CD pipeline with functional safety verification gates, OTA pipeline using TUF secure update framework.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"新功能上市时间从 18 个月缩短至 6 个月\\\", \\\"OTA 合规审批从 3 个月压缩至 3 天\\\", \\\"整车软件缺陷密度降低 60%\\\", \\\"3 个车型团队全面转型为产品型模式\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Feature time-to-market from 18 months to 6 months\\\", \\\"OTA compliance approval from 3 months to 3 days\\\", \\\"Vehicle software defect density reduced 60%\\\", \\\"3 vehicle program teams fully transitioned to product model\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-05 至 2025-11（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"上市时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Time-to-market\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"6 个月 / mos\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"OTA 审批\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"OTA approval\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"3 天 / days\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"缺陷密度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Defect density\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"-60%\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"tmt-ad-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"亚太头部电信与流媒体集团\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Leading APAC telco and streaming group\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"tmt\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该集团拥有超过 3 亿用户，但广告系统架构已服役 10 年，CPM 持续下滑，用户流失率逐年上升。内容推荐准确率低于行业平均水平。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 300M+ users, the group's ad-system architecture had been in service for 10 years with declining CPM and rising churn. Content recommendation accuracy was below industry average.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 重新设计了实时广告竞价与推荐引擎，采用深度学习和图神经网络实现超个性化。同步现代化了用户数据平台以支持实时特征工程，降低了基础设施单位成本。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing redesigned the real-time ad bidding and recommendation engine using deep learning and graph neural networks for hyper-personalization. Simultaneously modernized the user data platform for real-time feature engineering and reduced per-unit infrastructure costs.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 Spark/Flink 的实时特征管道，图神经网络推荐模型在 GPU 集群上运行，广告竞价延迟低于 50ms。用户数据平台统一 300M+ 用户画像，支持亚秒级查询。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Real-time feature pipeline on Spark/Flink, GNN recommendation models running on GPU clusters, ad bidding latency under 50ms. Unified user data platform for 300M+ profiles with sub-second queries.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"广告 CPM 提升 28%\\\", \\\"用户留存率提升 18%\\\", \\\"推荐点击率提升 35%\\\", \\\"基础设施单用户成本降低 40%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Ad CPM increased 28%\\\", \\\"User retention lift 18%\\\", \\\"Recommendation CTR increase 35%\\\", \\\"Per-user infrastructure cost reduced 40%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-07 至 2025-10（15 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"CPM 提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"CPM lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+28%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"留存率提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Retention lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+18%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"CTR 提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"CTR lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+35%\\\" }\n    ]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE\"","cwd":"/bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace","processId":"42857","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"inProgress","commandActions":[{"type":"unknown","command":"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/case-studies.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bank-ai-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"欧洲顶级全能银行（资产 > 5000 亿欧元）\", \"en\": \"Top European universal bank (assets > EUR 500B)\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"financial-services\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"ai-strategy\", \"data-intelligence\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该银行拥有 12 条业务线和超过 200 个独立数据源，AI 项目分散在各业务线，缺乏统一平台与治理。模型从开发到上线平均耗时 9 个月。\", \"en\": \"With 12 business lines and over 200 independent data sources, AI projects were scattered across silos with no unified platform or governance. Model time-to-production averaged 9 months.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 团队首先完成了全行 AI 就绪度评估，识别出 47 个高价值用例。随后设计了企业级 AI 平台架构（模型训练、推理、监控一体化），并帮助建立了 AI 治理委员会与负责任 AI 框架。\", \"en\": \"Evoing first completed a bank-wide AI readiness assessment, identifying 47 high-value use cases. We then designed an enterprise AI platform architecture (unified training, inference, monitoring) and helped establish an AI governance council and responsible AI framework.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 Kubernetes 的多租户 ML 平台，集成特征存储、模型注册中心与实时推理管道。采用联邦学习架构保护各业务线数据隐私。\", \"en\": \"Kubernetes-based multi-tenant ML platform with integrated feature store, model registry, and real-time inference pipelines. Federated learning architecture to protect business-line data privacy.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"模型推理延迟降低 60%\", \"AI 用例从概念到上线时间从 9 个月缩短至 8 周\", \"平台承载 12 条业务线、47 个活跃模型\", \"AI 治理合规覆盖率达到 100%\"], \"en\": [\"Model inference latency reduced 60%\", \"AI use-case time-to-production from 9 months to 8 weeks\", \"Platform serving 12 business lines, 47 active models\", \"AI governance compliance coverage at 100%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-09 至 2025-12（16 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"推理延迟降低\", \"en\": \"Latency reduction\" }, \"value\": \"60%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"用例上线时间\", \"en\": \"Time-to-production\" }, \"value\": \"8 周 / wks\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"活跃模型数\", \"en\": \"Active models\" }, \"value\": \"47\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"retail-platform-migration\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"北美零售巨头（年营收 > 500 亿美元）\", \"en\": \"North American retail giant (revenue > USD 50B)\" },\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"industry\": \"retail-consumer\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"code-modernization\", \"data-intelligence\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该公司核心交易系统运行在 20 年前的大型机单体架构上。黑色星期五流量高峰时系统多次濒临崩溃，每次变更需要 6 周冻结期。\", \"en\": \"The core transaction system ran on a 20-year-old mainframe monolith. The system nearly collapsed during Black Friday peaks, and every change required a 6-week freeze period.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计了绞杀者迁移策略：先从结账服务开始分拆，逐步将库存、定价、促销等模块迁移至 AWS 上的云原生微服务。同步建设了 GitOps 驱动的 CI/CD 流水线和混沌工程实践。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed a strangler-fig migration strategy: starting with checkout, progressively extracting inventory, pricing, and promotions into cloud-native microservices on AWS. Simultaneously built GitOps-driven CI/CD pipelines and chaos engineering practices.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 AWS EKS 的事件驱动微服务架构，使用 Kafka 实现异步解耦，DynamoDB 处理峰值事务，Istio 服务网格管理流量。\", \"en\": \"Event-driven microservices on AWS EKS, with Kafka for async decoupling, DynamoDB for peak transactions, Istio service mesh for traffic management.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"部署频率从每月 2 次提升至每日 20+ 次\", \"黑色星期五系统可用性达到 99.99%\", \"变更失败率从 35% 降至 2%\", \"基础设施成本降低 30%\"], \"en\": [\"Deploy frequency from 2/month to 20+/day\", \"Black Friday availability at 99.99%\", \"Change failure rate from 35% to 2%\", \"Infrastructure cost reduced 30%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-03 至 2025-09（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"部署频率\", \"en\": \"Deploy frequency\" }, \"value\": \"每日 20+ / 20+/day\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"系统可用性\", \"en\": \"Availability\" }, \"value\": \"99.99%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"变更失败率\", \"en\": \"Change failure rate\" }, \"value\": \"2%\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"manufacturing-operating-model\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"中国先进制造企业（全球 50+ 工厂）\", \"en\": \"Chinese advanced manufacturer (50+ factories globally)\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"manufacturing\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"operating-model\", \"code-modernization\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该企业拥有超过 2,000 名工程师分布在全球 5 个研发中心，但按职能（前端、后端、QA、运维）组织的团队导致交付缓慢，跨团队协调成本极高。\", \"en\": \"With 2,000+ engineers across 5 global R&D centers, the functionally-organized teams (frontend, backend, QA, ops) caused slow delivery and extremely high cross-team coordination costs.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计并推动了从职能型到产品型组织的转型：定义了 18 个产品领域、重组了 150+ 跨职能产品团队、建立了季度 OKR 节奏和产品运营委员会。同步建设了内部开发者平台以支持团队自治。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed and drove the transformation from functional to product-oriented: defined 18 product domains, reorganized into 150+ cross-functional product teams, established quarterly OKR cadence and product operations council. Built an IDP in parallel to support team autonomy.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"产品型组织架构分为 4 个业务单元 × 18 个产品领域，每个产品团队 8–12 人，配备产品经理、技术负责人和交付经理。IDP 提供自服务基础设施。\", \"en\": \"Product-oriented org structure with 4 business units × 18 product domains, each product team 8–12 people with PM, tech lead, and delivery manager. IDP provides self-service infrastructure.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"功能交付周期从 12 周缩短至 4 周\", \"工程师满意度调查得分提升 35%\", \"跨团队依赖项从 80 个减少至 15 个\", \"产品团队在 6 个月内实现全面自治\"], \"en\": [\"Feature delivery cycle from 12 weeks to 4 weeks\", \"Engineer satisfaction survey scores +35%\", \"Cross-team dependencies from 80 to 15\", \"Product teams fully autonomous within 6 months\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-06 至 2025-06（12 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"交付周期\", \"en\": \"Delivery cycle\" }, \"value\": \"4 周 / wks\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"工程师满意度\", \"en\": \"Eng. satisfaction\" }, \"value\": \"+35%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"跨团队依赖\", \"en\": \"Cross-team deps\" }, \"value\": \"15\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"healthcare-fhir-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"北美大型医疗集团（50+ 医院网络）\", \"en\": \"Large North American healthcare network (50+ hospitals)\" },\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"industry\": \"healthcare\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"ai-strategy\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"患者数据分散在 18 个不同的 EHR 系统、影像系统和实验室系统中。医生在诊断时需要手动查阅多个系统，平均耗时 15 分钟/患者。\", \"en\": \"Patient data scattered across 18 different EHR systems, imaging systems, and lab systems. Physicians spent an average of 15 minutes per patient manually consulting multiple systems during diagnosis.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 以 FHIR R4 标准构建了统一临床数据平台，在此之上开发了 AI 辅助临床决策支持系统。同步实施了零信任数据访问架构以保护 PHI。\", \"en\": \"Evoing built a unified clinical data platform using FHIR R4 standards, then developed an AI-assisted clinical decision support system on top. Simultaneously implemented zero-trust data access architecture to protect PHI.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"FHIR 数据互操作层连接所有 EHR 系统，临床数据湖存储标准化患者记录，AI 模型在 HIPAA 合规环境中运行，提供实时诊断建议和药物相互作用预警。\", \"en\": \"FHIR interoperability layer connecting all EHR systems, clinical data lake storing standardized patient records, AI models running in HIPAA-compliant environment delivering real-time diagnostic suggestions and drug interaction alerts.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"医生诊断准备时间从 15 分钟降至 2 分钟\", \"跨系统数据共享时间从数天降至近实时\", \"AI 辅助诊断准确率达专家水平（95% 一致性）\", \"零数据泄露事件（12 个月运行）\"], \"en\": [\"Physician diagnostic prep time from 15 min to 2 min\", \"Cross-system data sharing from days to near real-time\", \"AI-assisted diagnosis accuracy at expert level (95% concordance)\", \"Zero data breach incidents (12-month run)\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-01 至 2025-06（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"诊断准备时间\", \"en\": \"Diag. prep time\" }, \"value\": \"2 分钟 / min\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"AI 一致性\", \"en\": \"AI concordance\" }, \"value\": \"95%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"安全事件\", \"en\": \"Security incidents\" }, \"value\": \"0\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"energy-digital-twin\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"中东国家能源公司\", \"en\": \"Middle Eastern national energy company\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"energy\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"ai-strategy\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该公司的上游钻井和下游炼化系统由老化的 SCADA 控制，碳排放数据分散且不可审计。需要在 2030 年前实现 30% 碳减排，但缺乏量化基线。\", \"en\": \"Upstream drilling and downstream refining controlled by aging SCADA systems. Carbon emissions data was scattered and unauditable. Needed 30% carbon reduction by 2030 but lacked a quantified baseline.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 构建了涵盖上游到下游的数字孪生平台，集成实时 SCADA 数据与碳排放监测。部署了 AI 驱动的预测性维护和能耗优化算法，并升级了 OT 安全架构。\", \"en\": \"Evoing built a digital twin platform spanning upstream to downstream, integrating real-time SCADA data with carbon monitoring. Deployed AI-driven predictive maintenance and energy optimization algorithms, and upgraded OT security architecture.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"边缘计算网关采集 SCADA 数据，通过安全数据总线进入云端数字孪生引擎。AI 优化引擎运行在封闭的 OT 环境中，碳排放仪表板连接至国家 ESG 报告系统。\", \"en\": \"Edge computing gateways collect SCADA data through secure data bus into cloud digital twin engine. AI optimization engine runs in air-gapped OT environment. Carbon dashboard connects to national ESG reporting system.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"碳排放预测准确率达到 95%\", \"非计划停机减少 35%\", \"能耗降低 18%（相当于减排 120,000 吨 CO2/年）\", \"OT 安全合规达到 IEC 62443 标准\"], \"en\": [\"Carbon emission forecast accuracy at 95%\", \"Unplanned downtime reduced 35%\", \"Energy consumption reduced 18% (equivalent to 120,000 tonnes CO2/year)\", \"OT security compliance at IEC 62443\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-04 至 2025-12（20 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"碳预测准确率\", \"en\": \"Carbon forecast accuracy\" }, \"value\": \"95%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"能耗降低\", \"en\": \"Energy reduction\" }, \"value\": \"18%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"年减排\", \"en\": \"Annual CO2 reduction\" }, \"value\": \"120k 吨\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"gov-digital-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"东南亚国家数字化政府机构\", \"en\": \"Southeast Asian national digital government agency\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"public-sector\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"strategy-advisory\", \"code-modernization\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该国政府的 200+ 项公民服务分布在 40 个不同部门网站上，用户体验碎片化。公民平均需要访问 3 个网站才能完成一项跨部门服务。\", \"en\": \"The government's 200+ citizen services were spread across 40 different agency websites with fragmented UX. Citizens needed to visit an average of 3 websites to complete a single cross-agency service.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 协助设计了国家数字服务平台战略，构建了统一公民身份认证系统、服务编排引擎和跨部门数据交换网关。以敏捷方式在 6 个月内交付了首批 20 项高频服务。\", \"en\": \"Evoing helped design the national digital service platform strategy, building unified citizen identity, service orchestration engine, and cross-agency data exchange gateway. Delivered the first 20 high-frequency services in 6 months using agile delivery.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于微服务架构的政府数字平台，统一身份认证（OAuth 2.0 / OIDC），API 网关连接 40+ 部门后端系统，事件驱动架构实现跨部门业务流程编排。\", \"en\": \"Microservices-based government digital platform, unified identity (OAuth 2.0 / OIDC), API gateway connecting 40+ agency backend systems, event-driven architecture for cross-agency business process orchestration.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"公民服务满意度从 52% 提升至 84%\", \"跨部门服务完成时间从平均 7 天缩短至 2 小时\", \"首批 20 项服务在 6 个月内上线\", \"平台日活跃用户超过 200 万\"], \"en\": [\"Citizen service satisfaction from 52% to 84%\", \"Cross-agency service completion time from 7 days to 2 hours\", \"First 20 services live in 6 months\", \"Platform DAU exceeding 2 million\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-02 至 2025-08（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"公民满意度\", \"en\": \"Citizen satisfaction\" }, \"value\": \"84%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"服务完成时间\", \"en\": \"Service completion\" }, \"value\": \"2 小时 / hrs\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"日活跃用户\", \"en\": \"DAU\" }, \"value\": \"200 万+\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"automotive-sdv-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"欧洲豪华汽车制造商\", \"en\": \"European luxury automotive manufacturer\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"automotive\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"code-modernization\", \"operating-model\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该制造商从硬件定义向软件定义汽车转型，但传统 ECU 开发流程（V 模型、ASPICE）与敏捷软件开发文化存在根本冲突。OTA 更新审批流程长达 3 个月。\", \"en\": \"The manufacturer was transitioning from hardware-defined to software-defined vehicles, but traditional ECU development processes (V-model, ASPICE) fundamentally conflicted with agile software culture. OTA update approvals took 3 months.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计了 SDV 参考架构和符合 ISO 26262 / ISO 21434 的 CI/CD 流水线，建立了车云一体化开发平台。同步在 3 个车型团队中试点了产品型运营模式，将 OTA 审批流程自动化。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed an SDV reference architecture and ISO 26262 / ISO 21434-compliant CI/CD pipeline, establishing a vehicle-cloud unified development platform. Simultaneously piloted the product operating model in 3 vehicle program teams and automated the OTA approval process.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"集中式车辆计算机 + 区域控制器架构，车端运行实时容器化运行时（AUTOSAR Adaptive），云端 CI/CD 流水线包含功能安全验证门禁，OTA 管道采用 TUF 安全更新框架。\", \"en\": \"Central vehicle computer + zonal controller architecture, real-time containerized runtime on-vehicle (AUTOSAR Adaptive), cloud CI/CD pipeline with functional safety verification gates, OTA pipeline using TUF secure update framework.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"新功能上市时间从 18 个月缩短至 6 个月\", \"OTA 合规审批从 3 个月压缩至 3 天\", \"整车软件缺陷密度降低 60%\", \"3 个车型团队全面转型为产品型模式\"], \"en\": [\"Feature time-to-market from 18 months to 6 months\", \"OTA compliance approval from 3 months to 3 days\", \"Vehicle software defect density reduced 60%\", \"3 vehicle program teams fully transitioned to product model\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-05 至 2025-11（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"上市时间\", \"en\": \"Time-to-market\" }, \"value\": \"6 个月 / mos\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"OTA 审批\", \"en\": \"OTA approval\" }, \"value\": \"3 天 / days\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"缺陷密度\", \"en\": \"Defect density\" }, \"value\": \"-60%\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"tmt-ad-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"亚太头部电信与流媒体集团\", \"en\": \"Leading APAC telco and streaming group\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"tmt\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"ai-strategy\", \"data-intelligence\", \"code-modernization\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该集团拥有超过 3 亿用户，但广告系统架构已服役 10 年，CPM 持续下滑，用户流失率逐年上升。内容推荐准确率低于行业平均水平。\", \"en\": \"With 300M+ users, the group's ad-system architecture had been in service for 10 years with declining CPM and rising churn. Content recommendation accuracy was below industry average.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 重新设计了实时广告竞价与推荐引擎，采用深度学习和图神经网络实现超个性化。同步现代化了用户数据平台以支持实时特征工程，降低了基础设施单位成本。\", \"en\": \"Evoing redesigned the real-time ad bidding and recommendation engine using deep learning and graph neural networks for hyper-personalization. Simultaneously modernized the user data platform for real-time feature engineering and reduced per-unit infrastructure costs.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 Spark/Flink 的实时特征管道，图神经网络推荐模型在 GPU 集群上运行，广告竞价延迟低于 50ms。用户数据平台统一 300M+ 用户画像，支持亚秒级查询。\", \"en\": \"Real-time feature pipeline on Spark/Flink, GNN recommendation models running on GPU clusters, ad bidding latency under 50ms. Unified user data platform for 300M+ profiles with sub-second queries.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"广告 CPM 提升 28%\", \"用户留存率提升 18%\", \"推荐点击率提升 35%\", \"基础设施单用户成本降低 40%\"], \"en\": [\"Ad CPM increased 28%\", \"User retention lift 18%\", \"Recommendation CTR increase 35%\", \"Per-user infrastructure cost reduced 40%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-07 至 2025-10（15 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"CPM 提升\", \"en\": \"CPM lift\" }, \"value\": \"+28%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"留存率提升\", \"en\": \"Retention lift\" }, \"value\": \"+18%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"CTR 提升\", \"en\": \"CTR lift\" }, \"value\": \"+35%\" }\n    ]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE"}],"aggregatedOutput":null,"exitCode":null,"durationMs":null},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e301b-8339-7881-80a3-28c37b98135d","startedAtMs":1778924188962}}
< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_01_Xan9d4CUVNLArJqK73qr2360","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/case-studies.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"bank-ai-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"欧洲顶级全能银行（资产 > 5000 亿欧元）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Top European universal bank (assets > EUR 500B)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"financial-services\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该银行拥有 12 条业务线和超过 200 个独立数据源，AI 项目分散在各业务线，缺乏统一平台与治理。模型从开发到上线平均耗时 9 个月。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 12 business lines and over 200 independent data sources, AI projects were scattered across silos with no unified platform or governance. Model time-to-production averaged 9 months.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 团队首先完成了全行 AI 就绪度评估，识别出 47 个高价值用例。随后设计了企业级 AI 平台架构（模型训练、推理、监控一体化），并帮助建立了 AI 治理委员会与负责任 AI 框架。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing first completed a bank-wide AI readiness assessment, identifying 47 high-value use cases. We then designed an enterprise AI platform architecture (unified training, inference, monitoring) and helped establish an AI governance council and responsible AI framework.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 Kubernetes 的多租户 ML 平台，集成特征存储、模型注册中心与实时推理管道。采用联邦学习架构保护各业务线数据隐私。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Kubernetes-based multi-tenant ML platform with integrated feature store, model registry, and real-time inference pipelines. Federated learning architecture to protect business-line data privacy.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"模型推理延迟降低 60%\\\", \\\"AI 用例从概念到上线时间从 9 个月缩短至 8 周\\\", \\\"平台承载 12 条业务线、47 个活跃模型\\\", \\\"AI 治理合规覆盖率达到 100%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Model inference latency reduced 60%\\\", \\\"AI use-case time-to-production from 9 months to 8 weeks\\\", \\\"Platform serving 12 business lines, 47 active models\\\", \\\"AI governance compliance coverage at 100%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-09 至 2025-12（16 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"推理延迟降低\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Latency reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"60%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"用例上线时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Time-to-production\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"8 周 / wks\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"活跃模型数\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Active models\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"47\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"retail-platform-migration\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"北美零售巨头（年营收 > 500 亿美元）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"North American retail giant (revenue > USD 50B)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"retail-consumer\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该公司核心交易系统运行在 20 年前的大型机单体架构上。黑色星期五流量高峰时系统多次濒临崩溃，每次变更需要 6 周冻结期。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The core transaction system ran on a 20-year-old mainframe monolith. The system nearly collapsed during Black Friday peaks, and every change required a 6-week freeze period.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计了绞杀者迁移策略：先从结账服务开始分拆，逐步将库存、定价、促销等模块迁移至 AWS 上的云原生微服务。同步建设了 GitOps 驱动的 CI/CD 流水线和混沌工程实践。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed a strangler-fig migration strategy: starting with checkout, progressively extracting inventory, pricing, and promotions into cloud-native microservices on AWS. Simultaneously built GitOps-driven CI/CD pipelines and chaos engineering practices.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 AWS EKS 的事件驱动微服务架构，使用 Kafka 实现异步解耦，DynamoDB 处理峰值事务，Istio 服务网格管理流量。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Event-driven microservices on AWS EKS, with Kafka for async decoupling, DynamoDB for peak transactions, Istio service mesh for traffic management.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"部署频率从每月 2 次提升至每日 20+ 次\\\", \\\"黑色星期五系统可用性达到 99.99%\\\", \\\"变更失败率从 35% 降至 2%\\\", \\\"基础设施成本降低 30%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Deploy frequency from 2/month to 20+/day\\\", \\\"Black Friday availability at 99.99%\\\", \\\"Change failure rate from 35% to 2%\\\", \\\"Infrastructure cost reduced 30%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-03 至 2025-09（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"部署频率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Deploy frequency\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"每日 20+ / 20+/day\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"系统可用性\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Availability\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"99.99%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"变更失败率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Change failure rate\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2%\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"manufacturing-operating-model\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"中国先进制造企业（全球 50+ 工厂）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Chinese advanced manufacturer (50+ factories globally)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"manufacturing\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"operating-model\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该企业拥有超过 2,000 名工程师分布在全球 5 个研发中心，但按职能（前端、后端、QA、运维）组织的团队导致交付缓慢，跨团队协调成本极高。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 2,000+ engineers across 5 global R&D centers, the functionally-organized teams (frontend, backend, QA, ops) caused slow delivery and extremely high cross-team coordination costs.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计并推动了从职能型到产品型组织的转型：定义了 18 个产品领域、重组了 150+ 跨职能产品团队、建立了季度 OKR 节奏和产品运营委员会。同步建设了内部开发者平台以支持团队自治。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed and drove the transformation from functional to product-oriented: defined 18 product domains, reorganized into 150+ cross-functional product teams, established quarterly OKR cadence and product operations council. Built an IDP in parallel to support team autonomy.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"产品型组织架构分为 4 个业务单元 × 18 个产品领域，每个产品团队 8–12 人，配备产品经理、技术负责人和交付经理。IDP 提供自服务基础设施。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Product-oriented org structure with 4 business units × 18 product domains, each product team 8–12 people with PM, tech lead, and delivery manager. IDP provides self-service infrastructure.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"功能交付周期从 12 周缩短至 4 周\\\", \\\"工程师满意度调查得分提升 35%\\\", \\\"跨团队依赖项从 80 个减少至 15 个\\\", \\\"产品团队在 6 个月内实现全面自治\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Feature delivery cycle from 12 weeks to 4 weeks\\\", \\\"Engineer satisfaction survey scores +35%\\\", \\\"Cross-team dependencies from 80 to 15\\\", \\\"Product teams fully autonomous within 6 months\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-06 至 2025-06（12 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"交付周期\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Delivery cycle\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"4 周 / wks\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"工程师满意度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Eng. satisfaction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+35%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"跨团队依赖\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Cross-team deps\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"15\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"healthcare-fhir-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"北美大型医疗集团（50+ 医院网络）\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Large North American healthcare network (50+ hospitals)\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"amer\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"healthcare\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"患者数据分散在 18 个不同的 EHR 系统、影像系统和实验室系统中。医生在诊断时需要手动查阅多个系统，平均耗时 15 分钟/患者。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Patient data scattered across 18 different EHR systems, imaging systems, and lab systems. Physicians spent an average of 15 minutes per patient manually consulting multiple systems during diagnosis.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 以 FHIR R4 标准构建了统一临床数据平台，在此之上开发了 AI 辅助临床决策支持系统。同步实施了零信任数据访问架构以保护 PHI。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing built a unified clinical data platform using FHIR R4 standards, then developed an AI-assisted clinical decision support system on top. Simultaneously implemented zero-trust data access architecture to protect PHI.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"FHIR 数据互操作层连接所有 EHR 系统，临床数据湖存储标准化患者记录，AI 模型在 HIPAA 合规环境中运行，提供实时诊断建议和药物相互作用预警。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"FHIR interoperability layer connecting all EHR systems, clinical data lake storing standardized patient records, AI models running in HIPAA-compliant environment delivering real-time diagnostic suggestions and drug interaction alerts.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"医生诊断准备时间从 15 分钟降至 2 分钟\\\", \\\"跨系统数据共享时间从数天降至近实时\\\", \\\"AI 辅助诊断准确率达专家水平（95% 一致性）\\\", \\\"零数据泄露事件（12 个月运行）\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Physician diagnostic prep time from 15 min to 2 min\\\", \\\"Cross-system data sharing from days to near real-time\\\", \\\"AI-assisted diagnosis accuracy at expert level (95% concordance)\\\", \\\"Zero data breach incidents (12-month run)\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-01 至 2025-06（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"诊断准备时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Diag. prep time\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2 分钟 / min\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"AI 一致性\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"AI concordance\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"95%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"安全事件\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Security incidents\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"0\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"energy-digital-twin\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"中东国家能源公司\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Middle Eastern national energy company\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"energy\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该公司的上游钻井和下游炼化系统由老化的 SCADA 控制，碳排放数据分散且不可审计。需要在 2030 年前实现 30% 碳减排，但缺乏量化基线。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Upstream drilling and downstream refining controlled by aging SCADA systems. Carbon emissions data was scattered and unauditable. Needed 30% carbon reduction by 2030 but lacked a quantified baseline.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 构建了涵盖上游到下游的数字孪生平台，集成实时 SCADA 数据与碳排放监测。部署了 AI 驱动的预测性维护和能耗优化算法，并升级了 OT 安全架构。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing built a digital twin platform spanning upstream to downstream, integrating real-time SCADA data with carbon monitoring. Deployed AI-driven predictive maintenance and energy optimization algorithms, and upgraded OT security architecture.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"边缘计算网关采集 SCADA 数据，通过安全数据总线进入云端数字孪生引擎。AI 优化引擎运行在封闭的 OT 环境中，碳排放仪表板连接至国家 ESG 报告系统。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Edge computing gateways collect SCADA data through secure data bus into cloud digital twin engine. AI optimization engine runs in air-gapped OT environment. Carbon dashboard connects to national ESG reporting system.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"碳排放预测准确率达到 95%\\\", \\\"非计划停机减少 35%\\\", \\\"能耗降低 18%（相当于减排 120,000 吨 CO2/年）\\\", \\\"OT 安全合规达到 IEC 62443 标准\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Carbon emission forecast accuracy at 95%\\\", \\\"Unplanned downtime reduced 35%\\\", \\\"Energy consumption reduced 18% (equivalent to 120,000 tonnes CO2/year)\\\", \\\"OT security compliance at IEC 62443\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-04 至 2025-12（20 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"碳预测准确率\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Carbon forecast accuracy\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"95%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"能耗降低\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Energy reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"18%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"年减排\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Annual CO2 reduction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"120k 吨\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"gov-digital-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"东南亚国家数字化政府机构\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Southeast Asian national digital government agency\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"public-sector\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"strategy-advisory\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该国政府的 200+ 项公民服务分布在 40 个不同部门网站上，用户体验碎片化。公民平均需要访问 3 个网站才能完成一项跨部门服务。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The government's 200+ citizen services were spread across 40 different agency websites with fragmented UX. Citizens needed to visit an average of 3 websites to complete a single cross-agency service.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 协助设计了国家数字服务平台战略，构建了统一公民身份认证系统、服务编排引擎和跨部门数据交换网关。以敏捷方式在 6 个月内交付了首批 20 项高频服务。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing helped design the national digital service platform strategy, building unified citizen identity, service orchestration engine, and cross-agency data exchange gateway. Delivered the first 20 high-frequency services in 6 months using agile delivery.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于微服务架构的政府数字平台，统一身份认证（OAuth 2.0 / OIDC），API 网关连接 40+ 部门后端系统，事件驱动架构实现跨部门业务流程编排。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Microservices-based government digital platform, unified identity (OAuth 2.0 / OIDC), API gateway connecting 40+ agency backend systems, event-driven architecture for cross-agency business process orchestration.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"公民服务满意度从 52% 提升至 84%\\\", \\\"跨部门服务完成时间从平均 7 天缩短至 2 小时\\\", \\\"首批 20 项服务在 6 个月内上线\\\", \\\"平台日活跃用户超过 200 万\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Citizen service satisfaction from 52% to 84%\\\", \\\"Cross-agency service completion time from 7 days to 2 hours\\\", \\\"First 20 services live in 6 months\\\", \\\"Platform DAU exceeding 2 million\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-02 至 2025-08（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"公民满意度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Citizen satisfaction\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"84%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"服务完成时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Service completion\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"2 小时 / hrs\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"日活跃用户\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"DAU\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"200 万+\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"automotive-sdv-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"欧洲豪华汽车制造商\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"European luxury automotive manufacturer\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"emea\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"automotive\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"code-modernization\\\", \\\"operating-model\\\", \\\"cyber-resilience\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该制造商从硬件定义向软件定义汽车转型，但传统 ECU 开发流程（V 模型、ASPICE）与敏捷软件开发文化存在根本冲突。OTA 更新审批流程长达 3 个月。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"The manufacturer was transitioning from hardware-defined to software-defined vehicles, but traditional ECU development processes (V-model, ASPICE) fundamentally conflicted with agile software culture. OTA update approvals took 3 months.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 设计了 SDV 参考架构和符合 ISO 26262 / ISO 21434 的 CI/CD 流水线，建立了车云一体化开发平台。同步在 3 个车型团队中试点了产品型运营模式，将 OTA 审批流程自动化。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing designed an SDV reference architecture and ISO 26262 / ISO 21434-compliant CI/CD pipeline, establishing a vehicle-cloud unified development platform. Simultaneously piloted the product operating model in 3 vehicle program teams and automated the OTA approval process.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"集中式车辆计算机 + 区域控制器架构，车端运行实时容器化运行时（AUTOSAR Adaptive），云端 CI/CD 流水线包含功能安全验证门禁，OTA 管道采用 TUF 安全更新框架。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Central vehicle computer + zonal controller architecture, real-time containerized runtime on-vehicle (AUTOSAR Adaptive), cloud CI/CD pipeline with functional safety verification gates, OTA pipeline using TUF secure update framework.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"新功能上市时间从 18 个月缩短至 6 个月\\\", \\\"OTA 合规审批从 3 个月压缩至 3 天\\\", \\\"整车软件缺陷密度降低 60%\\\", \\\"3 个车型团队全面转型为产品型模式\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Feature time-to-market from 18 months to 6 months\\\", \\\"OTA compliance approval from 3 months to 3 days\\\", \\\"Vehicle software defect density reduced 60%\\\", \\\"3 vehicle program teams fully transitioned to product model\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-05 至 2025-11（18 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"上市时间\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Time-to-market\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"6 个月 / mos\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"OTA 审批\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"OTA approval\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"3 天 / days\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"缺陷密度\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Defect density\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"-60%\\\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"tmt-ad-platform\\\",\n    \\\"clientArchetype\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"亚太头部电信与流媒体集团\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Leading APAC telco and streaming group\\\" },\n    \\\"region\\\": \\\"apac\\\",\n    \\\"industry\\\": \\\"tmt\\\",\n    \\\"capabilities\\\": [\\\"ai-strategy\\\", \\\"data-intelligence\\\", \\\"code-modernization\\\"],\n    \\\"challenge\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"该集团拥有超过 3 亿用户，但广告系统架构已服役 10 年，CPM 持续下滑，用户流失率逐年上升。内容推荐准确率低于行业平均水平。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"With 300M+ users, the group's ad-system architecture had been in service for 10 years with declining CPM and rising churn. Content recommendation accuracy was below industry average.\\\" },\n    \\\"intervention\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"Evoing 重新设计了实时广告竞价与推荐引擎，采用深度学习和图神经网络实现超个性化。同步现代化了用户数据平台以支持实时特征工程，降低了基础设施单位成本。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Evoing redesigned the real-time ad bidding and recommendation engine using deep learning and graph neural networks for hyper-personalization. Simultaneously modernized the user data platform for real-time feature engineering and reduced per-unit infrastructure costs.\\\" },\n    \\\"architecture\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"基于 Spark/Flink 的实时特征管道，图神经网络推荐模型在 GPU 集群上运行，广告竞价延迟低于 50ms。用户数据平台统一 300M+ 用户画像，支持亚秒级查询。\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Real-time feature pipeline on Spark/Flink, GNN recommendation models running on GPU clusters, ad bidding latency under 50ms. Unified user data platform for 300M+ profiles with sub-second queries.\\\" },\n    \\\"results\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": [\\\"广告 CPM 提升 28%\\\", \\\"用户留存率提升 18%\\\", \\\"推荐点击率提升 35%\\\", \\\"基础设施单用户成本降低 40%\\\"], \\\"en\\\": [\\\"Ad CPM increased 28%\\\", \\\"User retention lift 18%\\\", \\\"Recommendation CTR increase 35%\\\", \\\"Per-user infrastructure cost reduced 40%\\\"] },\n    \\\"timeline\\\": \\\"2024-07 至 2025-10（15 个月）\\\",\n    \\\"metrics\\\": [\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"CPM 提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"CPM lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+28%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"留存率提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"Retention lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+18%\\\" },\n      { \\\"label\\\": { \\\"zh\\\": \\\"CTR 提升\\\", \\\"en\\\": \\\"CTR lift\\\" }, \\\"value\\\": \\\"+35%\\\" }\n    ]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE\"","cwd":"/bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace","processId":"42857","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"unknown","command":"cat > /bench/20260516-163845-evoing-global-site-cache/workspace/src/data/case-studies.json << 'ENDOFFILE'\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bank-ai-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"欧洲顶级全能银行（资产 > 5000 亿欧元）\", \"en\": \"Top European universal bank (assets > EUR 500B)\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"financial-services\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"ai-strategy\", \"data-intelligence\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该银行拥有 12 条业务线和超过 200 个独立数据源，AI 项目分散在各业务线，缺乏统一平台与治理。模型从开发到上线平均耗时 9 个月。\", \"en\": \"With 12 business lines and over 200 independent data sources, AI projects were scattered across silos with no unified platform or governance. Model time-to-production averaged 9 months.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 团队首先完成了全行 AI 就绪度评估，识别出 47 个高价值用例。随后设计了企业级 AI 平台架构（模型训练、推理、监控一体化），并帮助建立了 AI 治理委员会与负责任 AI 框架。\", \"en\": \"Evoing first completed a bank-wide AI readiness assessment, identifying 47 high-value use cases. We then designed an enterprise AI platform architecture (unified training, inference, monitoring) and helped establish an AI governance council and responsible AI framework.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 Kubernetes 的多租户 ML 平台，集成特征存储、模型注册中心与实时推理管道。采用联邦学习架构保护各业务线数据隐私。\", \"en\": \"Kubernetes-based multi-tenant ML platform with integrated feature store, model registry, and real-time inference pipelines. Federated learning architecture to protect business-line data privacy.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"模型推理延迟降低 60%\", \"AI 用例从概念到上线时间从 9 个月缩短至 8 周\", \"平台承载 12 条业务线、47 个活跃模型\", \"AI 治理合规覆盖率达到 100%\"], \"en\": [\"Model inference latency reduced 60%\", \"AI use-case time-to-production from 9 months to 8 weeks\", \"Platform serving 12 business lines, 47 active models\", \"AI governance compliance coverage at 100%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-09 至 2025-12（16 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"推理延迟降低\", \"en\": \"Latency reduction\" }, \"value\": \"60%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"用例上线时间\", \"en\": \"Time-to-production\" }, \"value\": \"8 周 / wks\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"活跃模型数\", \"en\": \"Active models\" }, \"value\": \"47\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"retail-platform-migration\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"北美零售巨头（年营收 > 500 亿美元）\", \"en\": \"North American retail giant (revenue > USD 50B)\" },\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"industry\": \"retail-consumer\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"code-modernization\", \"data-intelligence\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该公司核心交易系统运行在 20 年前的大型机单体架构上。黑色星期五流量高峰时系统多次濒临崩溃，每次变更需要 6 周冻结期。\", \"en\": \"The core transaction system ran on a 20-year-old mainframe monolith. The system nearly collapsed during Black Friday peaks, and every change required a 6-week freeze period.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计了绞杀者迁移策略：先从结账服务开始分拆，逐步将库存、定价、促销等模块迁移至 AWS 上的云原生微服务。同步建设了 GitOps 驱动的 CI/CD 流水线和混沌工程实践。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed a strangler-fig migration strategy: starting with checkout, progressively extracting inventory, pricing, and promotions into cloud-native microservices on AWS. Simultaneously built GitOps-driven CI/CD pipelines and chaos engineering practices.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 AWS EKS 的事件驱动微服务架构，使用 Kafka 实现异步解耦，DynamoDB 处理峰值事务，Istio 服务网格管理流量。\", \"en\": \"Event-driven microservices on AWS EKS, with Kafka for async decoupling, DynamoDB for peak transactions, Istio service mesh for traffic management.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"部署频率从每月 2 次提升至每日 20+ 次\", \"黑色星期五系统可用性达到 99.99%\", \"变更失败率从 35% 降至 2%\", \"基础设施成本降低 30%\"], \"en\": [\"Deploy frequency from 2/month to 20+/day\", \"Black Friday availability at 99.99%\", \"Change failure rate from 35% to 2%\", \"Infrastructure cost reduced 30%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-03 至 2025-09（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"部署频率\", \"en\": \"Deploy frequency\" }, \"value\": \"每日 20+ / 20+/day\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"系统可用性\", \"en\": \"Availability\" }, \"value\": \"99.99%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"变更失败率\", \"en\": \"Change failure rate\" }, \"value\": \"2%\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"manufacturing-operating-model\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"中国先进制造企业（全球 50+ 工厂）\", \"en\": \"Chinese advanced manufacturer (50+ factories globally)\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"manufacturing\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"operating-model\", \"code-modernization\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该企业拥有超过 2,000 名工程师分布在全球 5 个研发中心，但按职能（前端、后端、QA、运维）组织的团队导致交付缓慢，跨团队协调成本极高。\", \"en\": \"With 2,000+ engineers across 5 global R&D centers, the functionally-organized teams (frontend, backend, QA, ops) caused slow delivery and extremely high cross-team coordination costs.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计并推动了从职能型到产品型组织的转型：定义了 18 个产品领域、重组了 150+ 跨职能产品团队、建立了季度 OKR 节奏和产品运营委员会。同步建设了内部开发者平台以支持团队自治。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed and drove the transformation from functional to product-oriented: defined 18 product domains, reorganized into 150+ cross-functional product teams, established quarterly OKR cadence and product operations council. Built an IDP in parallel to support team autonomy.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"产品型组织架构分为 4 个业务单元 × 18 个产品领域，每个产品团队 8–12 人，配备产品经理、技术负责人和交付经理。IDP 提供自服务基础设施。\", \"en\": \"Product-oriented org structure with 4 business units × 18 product domains, each product team 8–12 people with PM, tech lead, and delivery manager. IDP provides self-service infrastructure.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"功能交付周期从 12 周缩短至 4 周\", \"工程师满意度调查得分提升 35%\", \"跨团队依赖项从 80 个减少至 15 个\", \"产品团队在 6 个月内实现全面自治\"], \"en\": [\"Feature delivery cycle from 12 weeks to 4 weeks\", \"Engineer satisfaction survey scores +35%\", \"Cross-team dependencies from 80 to 15\", \"Product teams fully autonomous within 6 months\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-06 至 2025-06（12 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"交付周期\", \"en\": \"Delivery cycle\" }, \"value\": \"4 周 / wks\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"工程师满意度\", \"en\": \"Eng. satisfaction\" }, \"value\": \"+35%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"跨团队依赖\", \"en\": \"Cross-team deps\" }, \"value\": \"15\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"healthcare-fhir-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"北美大型医疗集团（50+ 医院网络）\", \"en\": \"Large North American healthcare network (50+ hospitals)\" },\n    \"region\": \"amer\",\n    \"industry\": \"healthcare\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"ai-strategy\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"患者数据分散在 18 个不同的 EHR 系统、影像系统和实验室系统中。医生在诊断时需要手动查阅多个系统，平均耗时 15 分钟/患者。\", \"en\": \"Patient data scattered across 18 different EHR systems, imaging systems, and lab systems. Physicians spent an average of 15 minutes per patient manually consulting multiple systems during diagnosis.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 以 FHIR R4 标准构建了统一临床数据平台，在此之上开发了 AI 辅助临床决策支持系统。同步实施了零信任数据访问架构以保护 PHI。\", \"en\": \"Evoing built a unified clinical data platform using FHIR R4 standards, then developed an AI-assisted clinical decision support system on top. Simultaneously implemented zero-trust data access architecture to protect PHI.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"FHIR 数据互操作层连接所有 EHR 系统，临床数据湖存储标准化患者记录，AI 模型在 HIPAA 合规环境中运行，提供实时诊断建议和药物相互作用预警。\", \"en\": \"FHIR interoperability layer connecting all EHR systems, clinical data lake storing standardized patient records, AI models running in HIPAA-compliant environment delivering real-time diagnostic suggestions and drug interaction alerts.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"医生诊断准备时间从 15 分钟降至 2 分钟\", \"跨系统数据共享时间从数天降至近实时\", \"AI 辅助诊断准确率达专家水平（95% 一致性）\", \"零数据泄露事件（12 个月运行）\"], \"en\": [\"Physician diagnostic prep time from 15 min to 2 min\", \"Cross-system data sharing from days to near real-time\", \"AI-assisted diagnosis accuracy at expert level (95% concordance)\", \"Zero data breach incidents (12-month run)\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-01 至 2025-06（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"诊断准备时间\", \"en\": \"Diag. prep time\" }, \"value\": \"2 分钟 / min\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"AI 一致性\", \"en\": \"AI concordance\" }, \"value\": \"95%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"安全事件\", \"en\": \"Security incidents\" }, \"value\": \"0\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"energy-digital-twin\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"中东国家能源公司\", \"en\": \"Middle Eastern national energy company\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"energy\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"data-intelligence\", \"ai-strategy\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该公司的上游钻井和下游炼化系统由老化的 SCADA 控制，碳排放数据分散且不可审计。需要在 2030 年前实现 30% 碳减排，但缺乏量化基线。\", \"en\": \"Upstream drilling and downstream refining controlled by aging SCADA systems. Carbon emissions data was scattered and unauditable. Needed 30% carbon reduction by 2030 but lacked a quantified baseline.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 构建了涵盖上游到下游的数字孪生平台，集成实时 SCADA 数据与碳排放监测。部署了 AI 驱动的预测性维护和能耗优化算法，并升级了 OT 安全架构。\", \"en\": \"Evoing built a digital twin platform spanning upstream to downstream, integrating real-time SCADA data with carbon monitoring. Deployed AI-driven predictive maintenance and energy optimization algorithms, and upgraded OT security architecture.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"边缘计算网关采集 SCADA 数据，通过安全数据总线进入云端数字孪生引擎。AI 优化引擎运行在封闭的 OT 环境中，碳排放仪表板连接至国家 ESG 报告系统。\", \"en\": \"Edge computing gateways collect SCADA data through secure data bus into cloud digital twin engine. AI optimization engine runs in air-gapped OT environment. Carbon dashboard connects to national ESG reporting system.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"碳排放预测准确率达到 95%\", \"非计划停机减少 35%\", \"能耗降低 18%（相当于减排 120,000 吨 CO2/年）\", \"OT 安全合规达到 IEC 62443 标准\"], \"en\": [\"Carbon emission forecast accuracy at 95%\", \"Unplanned downtime reduced 35%\", \"Energy consumption reduced 18% (equivalent to 120,000 tonnes CO2/year)\", \"OT security compliance at IEC 62443\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-04 至 2025-12（20 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"碳预测准确率\", \"en\": \"Carbon forecast accuracy\" }, \"value\": \"95%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"能耗降低\", \"en\": \"Energy reduction\" }, \"value\": \"18%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"年减排\", \"en\": \"Annual CO2 reduction\" }, \"value\": \"120k 吨\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"gov-digital-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"东南亚国家数字化政府机构\", \"en\": \"Southeast Asian national digital government agency\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"public-sector\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"strategy-advisory\", \"code-modernization\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该国政府的 200+ 项公民服务分布在 40 个不同部门网站上，用户体验碎片化。公民平均需要访问 3 个网站才能完成一项跨部门服务。\", \"en\": \"The government's 200+ citizen services were spread across 40 different agency websites with fragmented UX. Citizens needed to visit an average of 3 websites to complete a single cross-agency service.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 协助设计了国家数字服务平台战略，构建了统一公民身份认证系统、服务编排引擎和跨部门数据交换网关。以敏捷方式在 6 个月内交付了首批 20 项高频服务。\", \"en\": \"Evoing helped design the national digital service platform strategy, building unified citizen identity, service orchestration engine, and cross-agency data exchange gateway. Delivered the first 20 high-frequency services in 6 months using agile delivery.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于微服务架构的政府数字平台，统一身份认证（OAuth 2.0 / OIDC），API 网关连接 40+ 部门后端系统，事件驱动架构实现跨部门业务流程编排。\", \"en\": \"Microservices-based government digital platform, unified identity (OAuth 2.0 / OIDC), API gateway connecting 40+ agency backend systems, event-driven architecture for cross-agency business process orchestration.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"公民服务满意度从 52% 提升至 84%\", \"跨部门服务完成时间从平均 7 天缩短至 2 小时\", \"首批 20 项服务在 6 个月内上线\", \"平台日活跃用户超过 200 万\"], \"en\": [\"Citizen service satisfaction from 52% to 84%\", \"Cross-agency service completion time from 7 days to 2 hours\", \"First 20 services live in 6 months\", \"Platform DAU exceeding 2 million\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-02 至 2025-08（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"公民满意度\", \"en\": \"Citizen satisfaction\" }, \"value\": \"84%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"服务完成时间\", \"en\": \"Service completion\" }, \"value\": \"2 小时 / hrs\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"日活跃用户\", \"en\": \"DAU\" }, \"value\": \"200 万+\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"automotive-sdv-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"欧洲豪华汽车制造商\", \"en\": \"European luxury automotive manufacturer\" },\n    \"region\": \"emea\",\n    \"industry\": \"automotive\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"code-modernization\", \"operating-model\", \"cyber-resilience\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该制造商从硬件定义向软件定义汽车转型，但传统 ECU 开发流程（V 模型、ASPICE）与敏捷软件开发文化存在根本冲突。OTA 更新审批流程长达 3 个月。\", \"en\": \"The manufacturer was transitioning from hardware-defined to software-defined vehicles, but traditional ECU development processes (V-model, ASPICE) fundamentally conflicted with agile software culture. OTA update approvals took 3 months.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 设计了 SDV 参考架构和符合 ISO 26262 / ISO 21434 的 CI/CD 流水线，建立了车云一体化开发平台。同步在 3 个车型团队中试点了产品型运营模式，将 OTA 审批流程自动化。\", \"en\": \"Evoing designed an SDV reference architecture and ISO 26262 / ISO 21434-compliant CI/CD pipeline, establishing a vehicle-cloud unified development platform. Simultaneously piloted the product operating model in 3 vehicle program teams and automated the OTA approval process.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"集中式车辆计算机 + 区域控制器架构，车端运行实时容器化运行时（AUTOSAR Adaptive），云端 CI/CD 流水线包含功能安全验证门禁，OTA 管道采用 TUF 安全更新框架。\", \"en\": \"Central vehicle computer + zonal controller architecture, real-time containerized runtime on-vehicle (AUTOSAR Adaptive), cloud CI/CD pipeline with functional safety verification gates, OTA pipeline using TUF secure update framework.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"新功能上市时间从 18 个月缩短至 6 个月\", \"OTA 合规审批从 3 个月压缩至 3 天\", \"整车软件缺陷密度降低 60%\", \"3 个车型团队全面转型为产品型模式\"], \"en\": [\"Feature time-to-market from 18 months to 6 months\", \"OTA compliance approval from 3 months to 3 days\", \"Vehicle software defect density reduced 60%\", \"3 vehicle program teams fully transitioned to product model\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-05 至 2025-11（18 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"上市时间\", \"en\": \"Time-to-market\" }, \"value\": \"6 个月 / mos\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"OTA 审批\", \"en\": \"OTA approval\" }, \"value\": \"3 天 / days\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"缺陷密度\", \"en\": \"Defect density\" }, \"value\": \"-60%\" }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"tmt-ad-platform\",\n    \"clientArchetype\": { \"zh\": \"亚太头部电信与流媒体集团\", \"en\": \"Leading APAC telco and streaming group\" },\n    \"region\": \"apac\",\n    \"industry\": \"tmt\",\n    \"capabilities\": [\"ai-strategy\", \"data-intelligence\", \"code-modernization\"],\n    \"challenge\": { \"zh\": \"该集团拥有超过 3 亿用户，但广告系统架构已服役 10 年，CPM 持续下滑，用户流失率逐年上升。内容推荐准确率低于行业平均水平。\", \"en\": \"With 300M+ users, the group's ad-system architecture had been in service for 10 years with declining CPM and rising churn. Content recommendation accuracy was below industry average.\" },\n    \"intervention\": { \"zh\": \"Evoing 重新设计了实时广告竞价与推荐引擎，采用深度学习和图神经网络实现超个性化。同步现代化了用户数据平台以支持实时特征工程，降低了基础设施单位成本。\", \"en\": \"Evoing redesigned the real-time ad bidding and recommendation engine using deep learning and graph neural networks for hyper-personalization. Simultaneously modernized the user data platform for real-time feature engineering and reduced per-unit infrastructure costs.\" },\n    \"architecture\": { \"zh\": \"基于 Spark/Flink 的实时特征管道，图神经网络推荐模型在 GPU 集群上运行，广告竞价延迟低于 50ms。用户数据平台统一 300M+ 用户画像，支持亚秒级查询。\", \"en\": \"Real-time feature pipeline on Spark/Flink, GNN recommendation models running on GPU clusters, ad bidding latency under 50ms. Unified user data platform for 300M+ profiles with sub-second queries.\" },\n    \"results\": { \"zh\": [\"广告 CPM 提升 28%\", \"用户留存率提升 18%\", \"推荐点击率提升 35%\", \"基础设施单用户成本降低 40%\"], \"en\": [\"Ad CPM increased 28%\", \"User retention lift 18%\", \"Recommendation CTR increase 35%\", \"Per-user infrastructure cost reduced 40%\"] },\n    \"timeline\": \"2024-07 至 2025-10（15 个月）\",\n    \"metrics\": [\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"CPM 提升\", \"en\": \"CPM lift\" }, \"value\": \"+28%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"留存率提升\", \"en\": \"Retention lift\" }, \"value\": \"+18%\" },\n      { \"label\": { \"zh\": \"CTR 提升\", \"en\": \"CTR lift\" }, \"value\": \"+35%\" }\n    ]\n  }\n]\nENDOFFILE"}],"aggregatedOutput":null,"exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e301b-8339-7881-80a3-28c37b98135d","completedAtMs":1778924188964}}
