ize code assets, and design future-ready operating models in the AI era.</span></p>\n        <div class=\"hero__actions\">\n          <a href=\"#solutions\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" data-target=\"solutions\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">了解我们的解决方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Explore Solutions</span></a>\n          <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn--outline-inverse btn--lg\" data-target=\"contact\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">联系我们</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Get in Touch</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== STATS ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section--alt\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"stats-banner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">500+</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球顾问</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Consultants</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">14</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球办公室</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Offices</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">200+</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">企业客户</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Enterprise Clients</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\"><div class=\"stat-item__value\">8</div><div class=\"stat-item__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业覆盖</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industry Verticals</span></div></div>\n  </div></div></section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CAPABILITIES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"capabilities\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心能力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Capabilities</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">智能驱动，代码落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intelligence-Driven, Code-Proven</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">六大核心能力覆盖从蓝图到上线的全周期。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Six core capabilities cover the full lifecycle from blueprint to production.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar\" data-filter-target=\".card\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\">AI</button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\">\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"ai-strategy\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9E0;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 战略与转型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">从战略规划到落地执行，帮助企业构建 AI 原生竞争力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">From strategic planning to execution, we help enterprises build AI-native competitiveness.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 成熟度评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Maturity Assessment</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">生成式 AI 落地</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Generative AI Implementation</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI 治理与合规</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI Governance &amp; Compliance</span></span></div></article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"code-modernization\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2328;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码现代化</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code Modernization</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过平台工程、架构演进和遗留系统改造，释放软件资产的长期价值。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Unlock the long-term value of software assets through platform engineering, architecture evolution, and legacy modernization.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">平台工程</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Platform Engineering</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">遗留系统迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legacy System Migration</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">云原生架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cloud-Native Architecture</span></span></div></article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"operating-model\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x2699;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营模式设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Operating Model Design</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">重塑组织架构、流程与人才体系，使技术真正驱动业务增长。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Reshape organizational structure, processes, and talent systems so technology genuinely drives business growth.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术组织设计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Org Design</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">敏捷与产品运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Agile &amp; Product Operations</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">变革管理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Change Management</span></span></div></article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"data-intelligence\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F4CA;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据智能</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Intelligence</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">打通数据孤岛，构建可扩展的数据平台与智能决策体系。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Break down data silos, build scalable data platforms and intelligent decision-making systems.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Strategy</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据平台架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Platform Architecture</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据治理</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data Governance</span></span></div></article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"cyber-resilience\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F6E1;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">网络韧性</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cyber Resilience</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">在日益复杂的威胁环境中，构建从预防到恢复的全周期安全能力。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Build full-cycle security capabilities from prevention to recovery in an increasingly complex threat landscape.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零信任架构</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Zero Trust Architecture</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">事件响应</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Incident Response</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">合规与审计</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Compliance &amp; Audit</span></span></div></article>\n        <article class=\"card\" data-category=\"strategy-advisory\"><div class=\"card__icon\">&#x1F9ED;</div><h3 class=\"card__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略咨询</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy Advisory</span></h3><p class=\"card__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">结合行业洞察与技术视野，为企业制定可执行的数字化增长战略。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Combine industry insight with technology vision to craft executable digital growth strategies.</span></p><div class=\"card__subs\"><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数字化战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Digital Strategy</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">技术尽职调查</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Technology Due Diligence</span></span><span class=\"card__sub\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">并购整合</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">M&amp;A Integration</span></span></div></article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== SOLUTIONS ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"solutions\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">解决方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Solutions</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">跨能力整合，端到端交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Cross-Capability, End-to-End Delivery</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\" style=\"color:var(--color-slate-300);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每一个解决方案都是多个核心能力的有机组合，针对具体业务挑战设计。点击卡片查看详情。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Each solution combines multiple core capabilities, designed for specific business challenges. Click a card for details.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--solutions\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\">AI</button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"solutions-grid\" id=\"solutions-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Solution detail drawer -->\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer__backdrop\" id=\"solution-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n  <div class=\"solution-drawer\" id=\"solution-drawer\">\n    <button class=\"solution-drawer__close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 class=\"solution-drawer__title\"></h2>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\">\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">业务挑战</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Business Challenge</span></p>\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__problem\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\">\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">我们的方法</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Our Approach</span></p>\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__approach\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\">\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心模块</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Core Modules</span></p>\n      <div class=\"solution-drawer__modules\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-xs);\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\">\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">预期成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Expected Outcomes</span></p>\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__text solution-drawer__outcomes\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__section\">\n      <p class=\"solution-drawer__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">关键指标</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Key Metrics</span></p>\n      <ul class=\"solution-drawer__metrics-list\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;\"></ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"solution-drawer__related\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ========== SERVICES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"services\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">服务产品</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Offerings</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每个能力，具体到交付物与时间线</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every Capability, Defined to Deliverables &amp; Timeline</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-3\" id=\"service-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== METHODOLOGY ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"methodology\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">方法论</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Methodology</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">六步闭环，从诊断到价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Six Steps from Diagnosis to Value Realization</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"methodology-timeline\" id=\"methodology-timeline\">\n        <div class=\"methodology-step methodology-step--active\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">1</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 1</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">诊断</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Diagnose</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过定量评估与利益相关方访谈，精准定位技术债务与 AI 就绪度差距。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Pinpoint technical debt and AI readiness gaps through quantitative assessment and stakeholder interviews.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">现状评估</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Assessment</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">债务热力图</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Heatmap</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">2–4 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">2–4 wks</span></p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">2</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 2</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">将诊断洞察转化为可执行路线图，明确投资优先级与成功度量。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Translate insights into an executable roadmap with clear priorities and metrics.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">路线图</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Roadmap</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">ROI 预测</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">ROI Forecast</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">3–6 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">3–6 wks</span></p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">3</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 3</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">原型</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prototype</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">以最小可行产品验证关键假设与业务价值，快速迭代。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Validate key assumptions and business value with MVPs, iterating rapidly.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">概念验证</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">POC</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">规模化蓝图</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Scale Blueprint</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">4</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 4</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">工程交付</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Engineer</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">以平台工程实践规模化交付生产级系统，确保质量与安全。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deliver production-grade systems at scale with platform engineering practices.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">生产平台</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Prod Platform</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">CI/CD</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">CI/CD</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">8–16 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">8–16 wks</span></p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">5</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 5</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营迁移</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Migrate</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">通过结构化交接与知识转移，确保客户团队自主运营。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ensure client teams can independently operate through structured handover.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交接计划</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Handover</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">知识库</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Knowledge Base</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">4–8 周</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">4–8 wks</span></p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-step\"><div class=\"methodology-step__marker\">6</div><div class=\"methodology-step__content\"><p class=\"methodology-step__phase\">Phase 6</p><h3 class=\"methodology-step__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值实现</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Realize</span></h3><p class=\"methodology-step__summary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续跟踪 KPI 与技术指标，通过季度回顾确保投资回报。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Continuously track KPIs and technical metrics through quarterly reviews.</span></p><div class=\"methodology-step__deliverables\"><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">价值仪表板</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Dashboard</span></span><span class=\"methodology-step__deliverable\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">季度回顾</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">QBR</span></span></div><p class=\"methodology-step__duration\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">持续</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ongoing</span></p></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"methodology-principles\">\n        <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码即战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code is Strategy</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">软件架构决策本身就是商业战略决策。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Software architecture decisions are inherently business strategy decisions.</span></p></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">客户能力内建</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Build Client Capability</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">衡量标准是客户能否独立前行。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">The measure is whether the client can move forward independently.</span></p></div>\n        <div class=\"methodology-principle\"><p class=\"methodology-principle__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">指标驱动决策</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Metrics-Driven</span></p><p class=\"methodology-principle__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">每个阶段都由可量化指标驱动，而非主观判断。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Every phase is driven by quantifiable metrics, not subjective judgment.</span></p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CASE STUDIES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"case-studies\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">案例研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Case Studies</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">交付成果，而非报告</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">We Deliver Outcomes, Not Decks</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">点击案例卡片查看完整故事：挑战、干预方案、架构设计与量化成果。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Click any case card for the full story: challenge, intervention, architecture, and quantified results.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--case-ind\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-md);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部行业</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Industries</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"financial-services\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">金融</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Financial</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"retail-consumer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">零售</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Retail</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"healthcare\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">医疗</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Healthcare</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"manufacturing\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">制造</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Manufacturing</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"energy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">能源</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Energy</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"tmt\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">TMT</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">TMT</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"public-sector\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">公共事业</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Public</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"automotive\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">汽车</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Auto</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--case-region\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部地区</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Regions</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"apac\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">APAC</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"emea\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">EMEA</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"amer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-studies-grid\" id=\"case-studies-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n\n      <div class=\"case-study-detail\" id=\"case-study-detail\">\n        <div class=\"case-study-detail__header\">\n          <h3 class=\"case-study-detail__title\"></h3>\n          <button class=\"case-study-detail__close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-study-detail__grid\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">挑战</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Challenge</span></p>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__text case-study-detail__challenge\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">干预方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intervention</span></p>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__text case-study-detail__intervention\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">架构与技术方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Architecture &amp; Technical Approach</span></p>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__text case-study-detail__architecture\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Results</span></p>\n            <ul class=\"case-study-detail__results\"></ul>\n            <p class=\"case-study-detail__timeline\"></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"case-study-detail__caps\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== INDUSTRIES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"industries\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">行业专长</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Industries</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">深谙行业，才懂变革</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Deep Industry Knowledge Drives Real Change</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">点击任一行业卡片深入了解痛点、方法与成果。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Click any card to explore pain points, approach, and outcomes.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-4\" id=\"industries-grid\">\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"financial-services\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">金融服务</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Financial Services</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"retail-consumer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">零售与消费品</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Retail &amp; Consumer</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"healthcare\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">医疗健康</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Healthcare</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"manufacturing\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">先进制造</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Advanced Manufacturing</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"energy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">能源与碳中和</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Energy &amp; Net Zero</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"tmt\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">科技媒体电信</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">TMT</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"public-sector\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">公共事业</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Public Sector</span></div>\n        <div class=\"region-card industry-summary-card\" data-industry=\"automotive\"><span data-lang=\"zh\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">汽车与出行</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\" style=\"font-size:var(--fs-h3);\">Automotive &amp; Mobility</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"industry-detail\" id=\"industry-detail-panel\">\n        <div class=\"industry-detail__header\"><h3 class=\"industry-detail__title\"></h3><button class=\"industry-detail__close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button></div>\n        <div class=\"industry-detail__grid\">\n          <div><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">核心痛点</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Key Pain Points</span></p><ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__pains\"></ul></div>\n          <div><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">Evoing 方法</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Evoing Approach</span></p><p class=\"industry-detail__approach\"></p><div class=\"industry-detail__caps\"></div></div>\n          <div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;\"><p class=\"industry-detail__section-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">预期成果</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Expected Outcomes</span></p><ul class=\"industry-detail__list industry-detail__outcomes\"></ul></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== OFFICES ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"offices\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球办公室</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Offices</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">三大洲 · 十四城</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Three Continents · Fourteen Cities</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"offices-tabs\">\n        <button class=\"offices-tab offices-tab--active\" data-region=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n        <button class=\"offices-tab\" data-region=\"apac\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">APAC</span></button>\n        <button class=\"offices-tab\" data-region=\"emea\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">EMEA</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></button>\n        <button class=\"offices-tab\" data-region=\"amer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"offices-grid\" id=\"offices-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== ARTICLES (expanded insights) ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--dark\" id=\"insights\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">洞见与研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Insights &amp; Research</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">思想领导力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Thought Leadership</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\" style=\"color:var(--color-slate-300);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">深度研究、行业分析与技术趋势洞察。点击文章查看纲要。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">In-depth research, industry analysis, and tech trend insights. Click to preview.</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--article-cat\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-md);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部主题</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Topics</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"ai-strategy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">AI</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">AI</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"code-modernization\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">代码</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Code</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"data-intelligence\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"cyber-resilience\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">安全</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Security</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"operating-model\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">运营</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Ops</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"strategy-advisory\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Strategy</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"filter-bar filter-bar--article-region\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\n        <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部地区</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All Regions</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"global\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"apac\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">APAC</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"emea\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">EMEA</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></button>\n        <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"amer\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"articles-grid\" id=\"articles-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Article preview modal -->\n  <div class=\"article-preview__backdrop\" id=\"article-preview-backdrop\"></div>\n  <div class=\"article-preview\" id=\"article-preview\">\n    <button class=\"article-preview__close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 class=\"article-preview__headline\"></h2>\n    <p class=\"article-preview__deck\"></p>\n    <div class=\"article-preview__sections-list\"></div>\n    <div class=\"article-preview__footer\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ========== LEADERSHIP ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"leadership\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">领导团队</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Leadership</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全球视野，本地深耕</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Global Perspective, Local Depth</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"leadership-grid\" id=\"leadership-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CAREERS ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section section--alt\" id=\"careers-sec\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-header__label\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">招贤纳士</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Careers</span></p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-header__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">与顶尖人才同行</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Work Alongside the Best</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"section-header__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">加入 Evoing，与全球顶尖的战略顾问和工程师一起定义智能与代码的未来。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Join Evoing and define the future of intelligence and code alongside top strategists and engineers.</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Values -->\n      <div class=\"careers-values\" id=\"careers-values\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n\n      <!-- Career paths -->\n      <div class=\"careers-paths\" id=\"careers-paths\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n\n      <!-- Open positions -->\n      <div style=\"margin-top:var(--space-2xl);\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--fs-h2);text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">开放职位</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Open Positions</span></h3>\n        <div class=\"jobs-filter\">\n          <button class=\"filter-chip filter-chip--active\" data-filter=\"all\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">全部</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">All</span></button>\n          <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"path-consulting\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">战略咨询</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Consulting</span></button>\n          <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"path-engineering\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">软件工程</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Engineering</span></button>\n          <button class=\"filter-chip\" data-filter=\"path-data-ai\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">数据与 AI</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Data &amp; AI</span></button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"jobs-grid\" id=\"jobs-grid\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Interview process -->\n      <div class=\"interview-process\" id=\"interview-process\"><!-- JS populated --></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== CONTACT ========== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"contact-grid\">\n        <div class=\"contact-info\">\n          <h2 class=\"contact-info__title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">开启对话</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Start the Conversation</span></h2>\n          <p class=\"contact-info__desc\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">无论您关注 AI 战略、代码现代化还是组织变革，我们的全球团队随时准备为您提供帮助。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Whether you're focused on AI strategy, code modernization, or organizational change, our global team is ready to help.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"contact-info__regions\">\n            <div class=\"contact-region\"><p class=\"contact-region__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">亚太</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Asia-Pacific</span></p><p class=\"contact-region__email\">apac@evoing.com</p></div>\n            <div class=\"contact-region\"><p class=\"contact-region__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">欧洲、中东与非洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">EMEA</span></p><p class=\"contact-region__email\">emea@evoing.com</p></div>\n            <div class=\"contact-region\"><p class=\"contact-region__name\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">美洲</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Americas</span></p><p class=\"contact-region__email\">amer@evoing.com</p></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contact-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"contact-form__row\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2xs);\"><input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Name / 姓名\"></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-2xs);\"><input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email / 邮箱\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <input class=\"contact-form__input\" type=\"text\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Company / 公司\">\n          <select class=\"contact-form__input\" name=\"capability\">\n            <option value=\"\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">选择感兴趣的能力</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Select Capability</span></option>\n            <option value=\"ai-strategy\">AI Strategy &amp; Transformation</option>\n            <option value=\"code-modernization\">Code Modernization</option>\n            <option value=\"operating-model\">Operating Model Design</option>\n            <option value=\"data-intelligence\">Data Intelligence</option>\n            <option value=\"cyber-resilience\">Cyber Resilience</option>\n            <option value=\"strategy-advisory\">Strategy Advisory</option>\n          </select>\n          <textarea class=\"contact-form__input contact-form__input--textarea\" name=\"message\" required placeholder=\"Message / 留言\"></textarea>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">发送消息</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Send Message</span></button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ========== FOOTER ========== -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer__grid\">\n        <div><p class=\"footer__brand\">Evoing</p><p class=\"footer__tagline\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">智能及代码，代码及智能。</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Intelligence and Code, Code and Intelligence.</span></p></div>\n        <div><p class=\"footer__col-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">导航</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Navigate</span></p><div class=\"footer__links\"><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#solutions\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">解决方案</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Solutions</span></a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#case-studies\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">案例研究</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Case Studies</span></a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#insights\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">洞见</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Insights</span></a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#careers-sec\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">招贤纳士</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Careers</span></a></div></div>\n        <div><p class=\"footer__col-title\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">法律与社交</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Legal &amp; Social</span></p><div class=\"footer__links\"><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#privacy\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">隐私政策</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Privacy Policy</span></a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"#terms\"><span data-lang=\"zh\">使用条款</span><span data-lang=\"en\" class=\"lang-hidden\">Terms of Use</span></a><a class=\"footer__link\" href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/evoing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\