< {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"bfce59c9-77c0-456c-b2a6-b4ae40864c48","text":"## Round 3 Complete — Evoing Full Marketing Site\n\n**Validation:** 349/349 checks passed, zero failures.\n\n**First-party lines:** 5,783 (up from 4,196 in Round 2). Gap to 10,000: 4,217 lines.\n\n### New Files (15 added)\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| `src/data/solutions.json` | 90 | 8 cross-capability solutions: AI-native enterprise, platform engineering, data mesh, zero trust, product op model, legacy-to-cloud, digital supply chain, sustainable tech |\n| `src/data/case-studies.json` | 138 | 8 detailed case studies with challenge, intervention, architecture, results, timeline, metrics |\n| `src/data/articles.json` | 134 | 12 article summaries with headline, deck, sections, authors, category, region, reading time |\n| `src/data/offices.json` | 156 | 14 global offices with addresses, focus areas, languages, timezone, contact |\n| `src/data/careers.json` | 114 | 4 values, 3 career paths, 8 job openings, 4-step interview process |\n| `src/css/solutions.css` | 195 | Solution cards, detail drawer with backdrop, slide-in animation |\n| `src/css/case-studies.css` | 193 | Case cards with industry/region tags, detail panel with results list |\n| `src/css/articles.css` | 212 | Article cards with section tags, preview modal with section list |\n| `src/css/offices.css` | 130 | Region tab filter, office cards with hub badges, focus tags |\n| `src/css/careers.css` | 217 | Value cards, career path cards, job cards with meta tags, interview steps |\n| `src/js/solutions.js` | 113 | Capability filter + detail drawer with data from embedded JSON |\n| `src/js/case-studies.js` | 123 | Dual filter (industry/region) + inline detail panel |\n| `src/js/articles.js` | 119 | Dual filter + preview modal with sections list |\n| `src/js/offices.js` | 30 | Region tab filtering |\n| `src/js/careers.js` | 32 | Job family filter |\n\n### Updated Files\n\n- `src/index.html` — added Solutions section (dark bg) with filter chips + detail drawer; replaced Cases with full Case Studies section with dual filter + detail panel; replaced Regions with Offices section with tab filter; replaced Insights placeholder with Articles section with dual filter + preview modal; expanded Careers with values, career paths, job listings with filter, interview process. Total: 45 files.\n- `src/css/main.css` — now imports 12 CSS modules (up from 7)\n- `src/js/main.js` — grew to 281 lines with 5 new render functions (`renderSolutions`, `renderCaseStudies`, `renderArticles`, `renderOffices`, `renderCareers`)\n- `scripts/validate.mjs` — 197 lines, validates all new data relationships (solution↔cap+industry, case-study↔industry+region+cap, article↔category, office↔region), 349 total checks\n\n### New Interactions\n\n- **Solutions** — filter by capability, click to open right-side detail drawer with problem, approach, modules, outcomes, metrics, related capabilities\n- **Case Studies** — dual filter by industry + region, click to expand inline detail panel with challenge, intervention, architecture, results, timeline\n- **Articles** — dual filter by category + region, click to open center modal with headline, deck, numbered section outline, authors, date\n- **Offices** — tab filter by region (All/APAC/EMEA/Americas), hub badges, focus area tags, timezone + languages\n- **Careers** — 4 values cards, 3 career path cards with level progression, 8 job cards filterable by family (Consulting/Engineering/Data & AI), 4-step interview process\n\n### Start & Validate\n\n```\nnpm start       → http://0.0.0.0:5173\nnpm test        → 349 checks (45 files, 15 data files, 12 CSS, 12 JS)\n```\n\n### Next Round Gaps\n\n- At 5,783 lines, need ~4,200 more. Bulk content should go into dedicated sub-pages rather than more index.html sections.\n- Individual article detail pages (12 articles × ~150 lines each)\n- Case study full pages with richer narrative\n- Office detail pages with local team, case studies, service focus\n- Privacy Policy and Terms of Use actual content\n- Solution detail sub-pages\n- Image assets and favicon files (currently SVG data URI)\n- `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`, and PWA manifest\n- Careers application flow page\n- The `src/data/cases.json` (old 3 cases) is now superseded by `case-studies.json` and could be removed or merged","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e2ff1-213e-7f10-918e-56ff4313a1e6","turnId":"019e301b-8339-7881-80a3-28c37b98135d","completedAtMs":1778925432103}}
